\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebetsanweisungen (Alcuinus: De psalmorum usu, in stark k\u252 \'fcrzender Bearbeitung)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si diuersis tribulacionibus et temptacionibus vndique fueris afflictus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et a deo derelictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   hos decanta psalmos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   deus meus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   respice in me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si vis agere penitenciam pro peccatis tuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dic septem psalmos penitenciales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si presens vita fuerit tibi fastidiosa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si vis omnipotentem deum laudare et gracias agere pro vniuersis beneficiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Confitemini domino quoniam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; Passionspsalmen Ps 21, 34, 54, 68, 108.
\par \pard\fi0\li720\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition des Quellentextes: Jonathan\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Black\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Psalm uses in Carolingian prayerbooks: Alcuin and the preface to \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  De psalmorum usu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Mediaeval Studies 64 (2002), S. 1\u8210 ?60, hier in der Reihenfolge Usus 4, 1, 5, 6, 7, 8, 2, 3, vgl. S. 42f. (dieses Initium); weitere Hss.: Basel, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. A X 98}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ; Mainz, StB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Hs I 215}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 b}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ; Rein, Stiftsbibl., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Hs 32}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Vgl. Clavis Galliae 2, S. 145\u8210 ?148 ALC 33.
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     Rezept (Nachtrag von zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssischer Hand) zur Anwendung bei Superfluitas humorum. Mit dem Vermerk \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hoc est quod omnes religiosos restituit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  // bricht ab, Blattende.}

