\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Hervorgehoben durch Blattweiser und vierzeilige Lombarden (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica die in matutinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Ps 20, (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Feria secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Ps 32, (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps 45, (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Feria quarta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Ps 59, (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quinta feria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Ps 73,  (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Feria sexta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Ps 85, (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sancto sabbato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Ps 101; (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Blattweiser und vierzeilige Fleuronn\u233 \'e9e-Initiale zum Vesperpsalmen-Beginn Ps 109.}

