\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fuit vir sub Maximiano imperatore Dyascorus nomine diues}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   valde militibus circumfultus ydola colens persecutor Christianorum magnissimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui habebat filiam nomine Barbaram et speciosam valde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Valerius pater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (oder presbyter?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  venerabilis, qui beatam virginem baptizauit, corpus eius reuerenter sepeliuit in sorcophago IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   kathenis aureis circumdatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , vbi multa fiunt miracula prestante domino nostro Ihesu Christo etc.
