\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De dominica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur de dominico die, qui est celebris propter multa. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primo quia eodem die omnes angeli creati sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De festis sanctorum: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item de ceteris festis nota: Quicumque celebrat festum sancti Petri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   vel alterius sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gloriam michi a te traditam omnino spreuit et cetera etcetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et hec de dominico die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
