\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo utilis et pulcer de 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   peccatis clamantibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui gladio occiderit gladio peribit Mt. XXVII (Mt 26,52). Ex quibus verbis sciendum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sunt peccata clamancia in celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contra naturam plus uel minus peccauerit seu continuauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  // bricht kurz vor dem Schluss ab; verglichen mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clm 14121}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 349\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -351\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
