\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Johanne baptista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hodie dilectissimi dies illuxit insignis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   tanto certis diebus sanccior quanto sancciorem hominem terris effudit. In hac siquidem die natus est ille sanctorum splendor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et sensus nostri paupertas non sufficit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sufficiant hec ad presens, que dicta sunt de laude Johannis ad gloriam redemptoris, qui est deus benedictus in secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
