\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Wita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancti Augustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctus Augustinus ex prouincia Affricana ciuitate Carthaginensi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  honestis parentibus christianis oriundus fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Grecam latinamque lingwam didicit et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  philosophus factus et sciencia inflatus incidit in errorem Manicheorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   XL\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etatis uero sue LXXVI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  episcopatus uero sui XLV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  coram positis fratribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et orantibus migrauit ad dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kurz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5/1, S. 259 Nr. 3 ist die Vita dieser Hs. unter BHL 788 aufgef\u252 \'fchrt (ebd., Nr. 2). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

