\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps.-Augustinus, Sermo app. LVI (Anfang in c. 2): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de flagellacione et correptione dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qvem enim diligit deus corrigit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Prv 3,12), }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 flagellat autem omnem filium}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 quem recipit}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (vgl. Hbr 12,6). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Igitur si omnem filium ad hoc}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   flagellat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 39, 1851, letzte Z.-1853; CPPM 1A, 841, 1B, 4413);
