\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omelia sancti Augustini de peccatore reuertente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave ueneranda pietas Christi uel dei, o testanda contumacia populi dicit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85;
