\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Sancto Amore}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo \u8222 \'84Qui amat periculum\rdblquote }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui amat periculum \u8230 \'85 (Sir 3,27). Item est sermo domini in corde meo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quasi ignis exestuans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ier 20,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Verbum sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (! lies: secundo) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  propositum scribitur III\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (? oder \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Jerem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sine cognitione uolunt esse iudices\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  testes sine visu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  falsi ac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [c]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  usatores omni veritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  carentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8210 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finis adest operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mercedem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Schreibervers unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit cartha finita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  feria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u252 \'fcbergeschrieben) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quarta et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  baba stara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amenn \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Traver\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The opuscula (wie oben), S. 155-178, zu dieser Hs. (= Sigle M) S. 92f.}

