\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aldobrandinus de Tuscanella}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expositio orationis dominicae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pater noster qui es in celis. Circa primum videtur, quod non sit conueniens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   orarare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (! lies: orare), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia secundum Danielem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (! lies: Damascenum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  oracio est petitio descendencium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (! lies: decentium) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ab hoc malo liberari dicens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sed libera nos a malo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Von anderer, schwer lesbarer Hand hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Solamen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sit sanctus spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scribentem sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scribo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed scribo huic quomodo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  affer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  michi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
