\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur tractatus necessarius simplicibus clericis de articulis fidei editus per predictum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  magistrum Franciscum de Maronis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notandum<, quod in exordio surgentis ecclesie XII apostoli congregati}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   descripserunt XII articulos fidei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Apud deum vnus dies sicut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mille et mille anni apud nos 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dies apud deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. II Pt 3,8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in illa eternitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad quam nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  perducat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui eternaliter viuit et regnat deus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8210 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit tractatus de articulis fidei etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; Rest der Seite leer.
