\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus Triumphus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de angelica annuntiatione (Tractatus super \u8218 \'82Missus est\lquote )}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus super Aue Maria fratris Augustini de Ancona magistri sacre theologie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Titel am oberen Rand nachgetragen). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quatuor mihi timorem et tremorem faciunt loqui de virgine gloriosa }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lectio I\u8210 ?XVIII: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Missus est \u8230 \'85 (Lc 1,26). In qualibet salutacione quinque per ordinem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   consideranda sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in hora mortis nostre acquirit saluatorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit tractatus super Aue Maria editus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a magistro Augustino de Anchona ordinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratrum heremitarum sancti Augustini complicatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (! wohl Verschreibung f\u252 \'fcr compilatus oder explicatus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de sancta Maria de Nasareth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Registrum lectionum et quaestionum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur tytuli questionum sew\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dubitationum supradicti tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tituli lectionis prime que incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Missus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \lquote  / am Rand die Anfangsworte der jeweiligen lectio vor den tituli der Quaestionen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: Augustini Triumphi Anconitani In salutationem et annunciationem angelicam deiparae praestitam commentarius. A M. F. Angelo Roccha \u8230 \'85 Rom 1590, p. 1-186 u. Index; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ministeri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (wie oben), S. 200-203 Nr. 32 (diese Hs. S. 201 genannt). \u8210 ? \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 2, S. 322 Nr. 409i;\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 2 u. 8, 1547 (diese Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 74-76 Nr. 136; CALMA 1 (wie oben), S. 547f. Nr. 35.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Leer.}

