\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones varii}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de nativitate domini: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantate domino canticum nouum etc. (Ps 95,1; 97,1; 149,1). Dies boni nuncii est et cetera (IV Rg 7,9). Vnde de illis rebus que mouent hominem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  magistri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad loquendum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  letitia cordis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ista est ystoria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Placens deo \u8230 \'85 (Sap 4,10). Ista verba debito Martino exponi possunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Possumus dicere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod ostenditur qualis fuit in uita qualis in morte et qualis post mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Orabat enim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; unten nach Verweiszeichen (f\u252 \'fcnfzackiger Stern) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reliquum quod sequitur invenies in secundo folio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de circumcisione domini: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Postquam consummati \u8230 \'85 (Lc 2,21). Festum hodiernum habet tria nomina}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia vocatur octaua domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Istud nomen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  concordat cum nomine matris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia Iesus et Maria etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus per suam etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De Epyphania domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum natus esset \u8230 \'85 (Mt 2,1). Presens festum tribus nominibus nuncupatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dicitur enim Epiphania domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et qui sic oculos inclinauerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ipse saluabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lvmen ad reuelacionem gencium (Lc 2,32). In ewangelio hodierno dicitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod est lumen et ideo portamus lumine sine candelas accensas in manibus ad ostendendum, Christus est lumen et cereus paradisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  saluus erit et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De annunciacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Missus est angelus \u8230 \'85 (Lc 1,26). Festum hodiernum vocatur annunciatio virginis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod tali die sicut est hodie angelus Gabriel venit ad uirginem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  beatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia desponsatus a patre eterno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [verschrieben]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus per suam et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancta Magdalena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lapis solutus calore \u8230 \'85 (Iob 28,2). Homo libenter audit noua magnifica}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et miranda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia anima hominis nobilissima est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia ardet tota amore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diuino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad illum ordinem perducat nos Iesus Christus et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; darunter Zusatz: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aiunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 quidam beatam Magdalenam sponsam fuisse}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ewangeliste Johannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; darunter weiterer Eintrag, beginnend lat., dann bair. (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tot habuit in se holocausta \u8230 \'85 Als mannich mail der sunden}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   si an i\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  r gehabt hat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  het si vnserem herren geopfert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [g]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anz irem hertzen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ;   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si quis mihi ministrauerit honorificabit \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Joh. (Io 12,26). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic notatur duo sancti Laur(entii)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  meritum ibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per totum mundum ecclesiis odorem sue nobilitatis effudit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Textschluss nach Maximus Taurinensis, Sermo XXIV,3, CCL 23, S. 94 Z. 49-54 bzw. Ps.-Augustinus, Sermo LXXXVII, 2, PL 39, 1914; CPPM 1A, 872); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancta Elizabeth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Scit omnis populus \u8230 \'85 (Rt 3,11). Booz ad Ruth. Verba proposita dicit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dominus ad sponsam suam Elizabeth commendando eam in tribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  alia multa opera misericordie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que in legenda eius invenies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De annunciacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pulcherrima mulierum ei eligitur. Iudith (! = Idc 5,30). Ista verba convenienter possunt aptari}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   beate virgini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quousque horrendo iudici miserum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  peccatorem reconcilies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (zum Textende vgl. Ps.-Johannes Chrysostomus, Homilia LII, PL 95, 1515C); hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vnde legitur Actuum IXo: Quod erat quedam mulier nomine Thabita}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   plena operibus bonis et elemosinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. Act 9,36) \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ?  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  propter opera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  misericordie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que per ipsam circumstant et orant pro ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; darunter\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Legitur quod cum David numeraverat populum, quod dominus prohibuerat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad se peccatores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Initium und Schluss des Sermo \u8218 \'82De annunciacione\lquote  (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. 8, S. 328 Nr. 15 (S28); zum Initium vom zweiten Sermo \u8218 \'82De annunciacione\lquote  (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. 2, S. 228 Nr. 282 (Greculus, Sermones de sanctis).}

