\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit de die dominice resurrectionis liber septimvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Octavam illam qu\u281 e in Paralipomenon et in superscriptionibus quorundam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   inuenitur psalmorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tanto difficilior uictoria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
