\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24 Passio beat\u281 \'ea Agath\u281 \'ea virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24 qv\u281 \'ea passa est in Sicilia \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  provintia vrbe Catinensivm svb Decio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  imperatore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ips\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [o] (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (! lies: Decio) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ter consvle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  die n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  febr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Quintianus consularis Siciliae audiens sanctam opinionem uirginis}}\plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24  deo dicatae Agath\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24 sanctae eos Agath\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orationibus et meritis liberaret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Passa est autem beatissima uirgo dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Agathae die non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  febr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  agente Quintiano consulare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  regnante domino nostro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
