\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit passio sanctae Lvciae virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum per vniversam provinciam Siciliam beatissim\u281 \'ea uirginis Agath\u281 \'ea fama}}\plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  crebresceret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic fabricata est in eodem loco basilica in qua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orationes eius florent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sepulchrum eius fauente domino nostro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Passio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancte Lvcie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; darunter Anfang des Responsoriums (teilweise radiert): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Recordare mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  omni potentatui dominans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   // (CAO 7511); Rest der Seite leer.
