\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In summi tonantis onomate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Incipivnt avtenticae eglog\u281 \'ea sacro sancto prolate docmatae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Incipit expositio miss\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Primum in ordine miss\u281 \'ea antyphona ad introitum ponitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quam in his etiam uerbis ultimam commendauit apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finiunt egloge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition: Daniela \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mazzuconi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La diffusione dell\rquote Expositio missae \u8222 \'84Primum in ordine\rdblquote  e l\rquote Expositio orationis dominicae cosidetta milanese, in: Ricerche storiche sulla Chiesa Ambrosiana. Storia eucaristica di Milano XI. Mailand 1982 (Archivio Ambrosiano 45), S. 208-266, Text S. 225-248; diese Hs. S. 211f. u. 209 genannt (= Sigle Z), aber nicht zur Edition herangezogen. \u8210 ? Zur unsicheren Autorschaft Alcuins vgl. Clavis Galliae 2, S. 379 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ALC\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  57\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (diese Hs. genannt).}

