\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Inquisitio beati Damasi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24 pap\u281 \'ea urbis Rom\u281 \'ea ad Hieronimum presbiterum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Frater et conpresbiter noster Hieronime}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Responsio Hieronimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine et dulcissime pater, tibi ueritas minime absconsa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aliis uero horis licitum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Papa dixit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rectum est quod dixisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
