\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 >\plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24 In Christi nomine liber II de officio miss\u281 \'ea scilicet expositio ethica et theorica per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  interrogationem et responsionem a quodam sapiente edita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Interrogatio:< Quid est officium?}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Responsio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Opus diuinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tunc predicitur a diacono licentia eundi peracta missa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
