\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt interrogationes de symbolo apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qvo nomine uocatur h\u230 \'e6c doctrina fidei?}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Symbolum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Int\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Symbolum autem greca lingua dicitur an latina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ? >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Greca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Latina uero dicitur conlatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ubi Moyses dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ego sequester et melius fui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Dt 5,5), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est obsecundans mandatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  huiusque legationis mediator existeret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
