\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item de liberatione primi hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expositiones Hrabani cuiusdam sapientis de quo uestri referebant apices}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   super liberatione et ereptione Ade primi hominis cum uerbis auctoris beati Gregorii Nanzanzeni \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gregorius Nazianzenus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  placuit nobis conferre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  unde nos arbor sciendi malum et bonum inportune et extra tempus sumpta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  depulerat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ;
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Anfang aus Hrabanus Maurus, Commentarium in Librum Sapientiae, liber II cap. VII: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hrabbani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nam per sapientiam tuam sanati sunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et rel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec illum qui primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  finctus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Sap 9,19-10,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Post sed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum propter transgressionem mandati de paradyso est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est ne opus suum in homine funditus interiret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Qu\u281 \'ea secuntur de liberatione primi parentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in libro Gregorii repperi Nanzanzeni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (ab dem Zitat von Gregorius Nazianzenus z. T. gleichlautend mit dem oberen Text): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Christus ergo pro}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Adam}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 pro eo qui factus est sub peccato}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod supra erat redderetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Completur ergo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 nouum misericordi\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et extra tempus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sumpta depulerat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
