\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De uariis generibus monachorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ysidorus ait: Sex genera monachorum sunt, quorum tria optima}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Egyptiorum lingua sarabaite siue renuite nuncupati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XVI,4 mit Zusatz (s. App. in Edition zu Z. 37): \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contemplatione theorica uiuentes perseuerant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed isti de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  examinatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per obedientiam eliguntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8218 \'82De tonsura\lquote  sub forma dialogi: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De tonsvra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Int}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 .<: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quid est tonsura}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ?}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Signum quoddam quod in corpore quidem figuratur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iam in euangelio est declaratum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
