ang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cuius adiutorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  genus propagaret humanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
