\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De trina opinione fidelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quando ueniat dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cuius quidem aduentus merito sancti omnes diligent}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui nihil eorum aut firmat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aut negat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De temporibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Antichristi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (! lies: Duo) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sane certissima necdum instantis diei iudicii habemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De die iuditii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  LXV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Adueniet autem dies domini}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u8230 \'85 (II Pt 3,10)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ubicumque cum illo fuerimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
