\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Titel fehlt (auf 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   nachgetragen von Hand des 14. Jh.s: >.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  g\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ponitur in sequentibus pro glosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <); (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut in< ueteri testamento post legem Moisi in qua precepta uiuendi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sufficienter tradita fuerant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ita nouum continetur in ueteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quasi rota in rota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ez 1,16); (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb/va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Romanos: (Absatzzeichen) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Post hec de ordine epistolarum uidendum est. Non enim eo ordine sunt}}\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24  in libro posit\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Corinthios I: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Corinthus metropolis est Achaie. Cuius populus per ipsum apostolum ad fidem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   est conuersus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Corinthios II: \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 Paulus apostolus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quibusdam Corinthiorum per precedentem epistolam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Galatas: : [P]\plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 aulus apostolus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Galli qui prius a candore corporis dicti sunt Galathi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \u8230 \'85; (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Ephesios: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ephesi sunt Asiani. Ephesus enim metropolis est Asie}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Philippenses: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 hilippis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 metropolis est in Macedonia}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 vnde Philippenses nominantur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Hebraeos: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 I]n primitiua ecclesia quidam Hebreorum confitentes Christum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 Vmbram\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Postquam probauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod semel mori suffecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  umbra quedam est non imago\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que est pictura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  plene formata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, endet in Hrb 10,1; auf 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Beginn von cap. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < falsch in 9,28 mit Kapitelzeichen angemerkt; korr. von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand, 14. Jh.: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hoc capitulum deest et 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sequencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); Bibelzitate unterstrichen; Angabe der Paulusbriefe in Kopftitelzeile, 14. Jh.; rote arabische Kapitelzahlen am oberen Rand angegeben und Beginn im Text mit rotem Kapitelzeichen markiert;
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad evangelium secundum Iohannem: (am Rand, 14. Jh\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .: Super ewangelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  principio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \lquote ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Inter ceteros euangeliorum scriptores Iohannes, qui hoc euangelium scripsit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dignior fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non secundum generis identitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8210 ? Nachtrag, 14. Jh. (gleiche Hand wie in Kopftiteln): \u183 \'b7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u183 \'b7 / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Romanos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad Corinthios\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad Galathas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad Ephesios\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad Philippenses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   korr.], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad Ebreos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; in Spalte unten von gleicher Hand Besitzvermerk (s. oben, Herkunft).    
