\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ordinis totius missae expositio prior: \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Incipit ordo miss\u281 \'ea a sancto Petro institvtus cvm expositione sva\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Missa pro multis causis celebratur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et erant semper in templo laudantes deum et benedicentes domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!); (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ordinis totius missae expositio altera (sub forma dialogi): >\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Item alia expositio tocivs miss\u281 \'ea ex concordia d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [iuina]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rvm scriptvrarvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Introitus miss\u281 e quare dicitur? R.: Eo quod per illvm introitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  benedictionem a populo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qu\u281 \'ea numquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  derelinquat sumencivm corda corpus et sanguinem Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Concilio Toletanv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  capit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  XCIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Post oracionem dominicam et coniuncionem panis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  extra chorum populus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Ordo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   VII: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Te igitur, clementissime pater vsque habeas et benedicas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut de munere temporali fiat nobis remedivm sempiternum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per dominum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0    
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Edition: Amalarii episcopi opera liturgica omnia, ed. Jean Michel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hanssens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. III. Vatikanstadt 1950 (Studi e testi 140), S. 296-315, S. 316-321 (Clm 14690 = Sigle M, Monachensis 9); Amalarii episcopi opera \u8230 \'85, ed. Jean Michel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hanssens. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Bd. I. Vatikanstadt 1948 (Studi e testi 138), S. 32; erstmalige Edition \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Le premier commentaire d\rquote Amalaire sur la messe?, in: Ephemerides liturgicae 44 (1930), S. 24-46, zu dieser Hs. (= Sigle M) S. 28-30; Le Pontifical romano-germanique du dixi\u232 \'e8me si\u232 \'e8cle. Le texte I, ed. Cyrille \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vogel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   / Reinhard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Elze\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Vatikanstadt 1963 (Studi e testi 226), S. 329-350; Ordo VII bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Andrieu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ordines Romani 2, S. 294-305 (Clm 14690 = Sigle N), zu diesem Ordo und seiner \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. 253ff.; parallel \u252 \'fcberliefert (ohne Ordo VII) in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 14628}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ; keine direkte Abh\u228 \'e4ngigkeit feststellbar.   }

