\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber soliloquiorum compositus per uenerabilem patrem Augustinum yponensem episcopum capitulum 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Agnoscam te}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ,}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 domine congnitor}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 meus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  omnis magnificencia, omnis beatitudo, omnis clemencia sit deo patri et filio et spiritu sancto. Amen etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber soliloquiorum beati Augustini etc. Amen dicam, ut cum Cristo maneamus etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
