\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio und \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt capitula regule beati Ieronimi presbyteri ad sacras virgines etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De caritate et vnitate seruanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  circa obseruacionem ordinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  41\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit regula beati Ieronimi presbiteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ordo vivendi deo eximij doctoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ieronimi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  centum eam virginibus ibidem prefecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praefatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tepescens in membris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  penitere non possit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De caritate et vnitate seruanda capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quis autem in monasterio constitutis sororibus primus sit arripiendus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  senectutem deuoti vestri Ieronimi sanctis vestris iuuate orationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
