\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In principio erat verbum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui scribendi sunt libros Iohannis ultimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit ordo gestorum Christi cum concurrenciis euangelistarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  licet enim IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   euangeliste gesta Christi cum summa diligencia conscripserunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  minime tamen ordinem ponere curauerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
