\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit Vita Sancti Virgilii episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad presentem beatissimi patris nostri Virgilii memoriam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   nos diligentius hortantur. Beatissimus igitur Virgilius in Hybernia insula de nobili ortus prosapia ... \endash ... principi preposuit impotentem. Explicit per manus fratris Leonardi de Ratispona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
