\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De tribus partibus poenitentiae (Tractatus octo IV)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus de penitencia reverendi magistri Nico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  lai\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de Dinckelspuhel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecce nunc tempus acceptabile ... (II Cor 6,2). Duo sunt tempora hominis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  peccet contra caritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contra fidelitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contra triplex ius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  naturale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ecclesiasticum et diuinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a quo nos custodiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui sine fine viuit et regnat etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et hec de penitencia sufficiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini 1451 in vigilia S. Perpetue et Felicitatis martyrum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (= 7. M\u228 \'e4rz 1451); auf 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Auflistung von 22 kirchenrechtlichen Vergehen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sinodalis constitucio, sub pena suspensionis ab ingressu ecclesie precipitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Occupacio bonorum relictorum a clericis mortuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hij 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Druck: Nycholai D\u252 \'fcnckelsp\u252 \'fchel Tractatus ... Stra\u223 \'dfburg 1516 (VD16 N 1531), fol. 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  St. Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 14309}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (wohl Vorlage f\u252 \'fcr diese Hs.). \endash  Zur weiteren \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 180-186 (diese Hs. genannt, S. 185). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (mit Supplement) 1866. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2011), S. 2905.}

