3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), 17. Predigt (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); folgt Sermo 12a des Predigtzyklus \u8222 \'84De dilectione Dei et proximi\ldblquote : (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De accidia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Post ea, que dicta sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui talia ignorant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) folgt Sermo 8 des Predigtzyklus \u8222 \'84De dilectione Dei et proximi\ldblquote : >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De reconciliacione fraterna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut quilibet homo compos rationis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et coheres naturalis eius filij domini nostri Iesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui est in secula benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et sic est finis.< Explicit tractatus de septem viciis mortalibus compillatus per reuerendum doctorem Nicolaum de Dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel, scriptum per me Ieorium Institorem de Geisenweldt. Anno domini MoCCCoLo, sabbato ante festum sancti Emmerami}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ((= 19. September 1450).
