\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hunc librum composuit Seneca ... sententiarum breuitate refulget\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prologus in librum Senece de remedys fortuitorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Licet cunctorum poetarum carmina}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut illam lugeas, cum maritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cogitaveris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
