\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (S. 1-35) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Abbas}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber de septem vitiis et septem virtutibus cum commento}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Haupttext: Nach gestrichener \u220 \'dcberschrift \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus Dacus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   folgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Seneca de arbore virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ardua virtutum faciles cape}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  solent frigidiora fore. Laus deo. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic finitur Seneca de arbore virtutum per me Iohannem R\u246 \'f6mer tunc temporis sanctorum Zwickauie. Anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo octagesimo quinto. 1485. Iohannes R\u246 \'f6mer de Ratispona}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   = S. 1-32) Kommentar (Marginalglossen): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sciendum, quod istius libri 4or sunt cause}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ex quo meretricum penetraciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  montis inferiorum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; der Haupttext ist durchgehend mit Interlinearglossen f\u252 \'fcr den Unterrichtsgebrauch aufbereitet; (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   = S. 36-44) leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Johannis abbatis \u8222 \'84Liber de VII viciis et VII virtutibus\ldblquote , ed. Heinz-Willi \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Klein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Mittellateinisches Jahrbuch 9 (1973), S. 173-247, zu dieser Hs. = Sigle M\plain \f1\sub\lang1033\fs20 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   und ihrem Textbestand vgl. S. 183. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 4 (1982), Sp. 535f. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   479. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia carminum 1456. \endash  Vgl. auch Joseph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sz\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rffy\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Secular Latin lyrics and minor poetic forms. A historical survey and literary repertory from the tenth to the late fifteenth century. Bd. 2. Concord 1993 (Medieval classics. Publications of the archives for medieval poetry 26), S. 431. \endash  Bei Jane \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stevenson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Woman Latin poets. Language, gender, and authority, from antiquity to the eighteenth century. Oxford 2005, S. 511 irrt\u252 \'fcmlich Angela Nogarola (um 1400-1430) zugeschrieben.}

