\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A rudis (!) rite libri tractantur inique ... Noli per cras, cras longas tibi ponere metas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 17109a) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Math. XXIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dilatant enim philateria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Mt 23,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In quibus scripta erat lex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; am oberen und rechten Blattrand Glossen, z. T. verblasst und beschnitten; (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Versus de BMV: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Virgo salutatur, innupta manens grauidatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fruitur iam luce parata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 20550).}

