\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einleitender Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circa initium glose secunde partis volo, priusquam ad textum procedam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   aliqua notabilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur nunc textus incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8222 \'84\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iubet ordo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \ldblquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic iubet ordo libri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quos ego cerno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar zum Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ista est 2a pars magistri Alexandri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed debilitati exoro sincere esse computandi. Que autem bene viriliter dicta sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   omnipotenti deo prode precor exhiberi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   cui sit honor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 finita est hec glosa anno domini MoCCCCoLXXIo in die purificacionis beate Marie virginis (= 2. Februar 1471) per me fratrem Iacobum Schlehen de Vilsecgk monachum ordinis sancti Benedicti professum in monasterio sancti Emmerami martiris quod situm est in ciuitate Ratispona}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro Christi laude libros lege postea claude\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ! (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 22460a).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ungedruckt. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 14898}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Edition (Haupttext): Dietrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Reichling\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Das Doctrinale des Alexander de Villa-Dei. Kritisch-exegetische Ausgabe. Berlin 1893 (Monumenta Germaniae Paedagogica 12) (zu dieser Hs. vgl. S. CXLIX Nr. 125), S. 70-99. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bursill-Hall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   S. 154 Nr. 135,2. \endash  Zur Schreibernennung vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Colophons\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,  7991. \endash  Vgl. Simona Polidori, in: CALMA 1 (2000), S. 177f., hierzu S. 177.}

