\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Processus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quomodo S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Andree apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [caput] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Romam delatum est sub pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Pio pontifice maximo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< Einleitung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si qua sunt memorie commendanda ex hijs}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed apostolo benignas aures accomodetis oro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Haupttext: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Andrea et quomodo caput eius Roman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  delatum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Andreas apostolus Ihesu Christi, beati Petri germanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  donec loculus eius ydoneus apparari posset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non pro honore et decore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  verum eciam pro gloria magistri eius saluatoris Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen laudetur deus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
