\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Alexander de Villa Dei}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Doctrinale I-II cum commento}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einleitung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circa notandum, quod subiectum presenti noticie est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  principaliter et conclusiones etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext von Teil I: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Scribere clericulis paro doctrinale nouellis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  verborumque data sit declinacio quarta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar zu Teil I: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ego magister Allexander intendo scribere unum librum doctrinale}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  forme sunt quarte coniugacionis ut amaturis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis huius prime partis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deo patri sit gloria eiusque soli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <, darunter: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  decanus \endash  deckhant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einleitung zu Teil II: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circa initium secunde partis est notandum, quoniam dubitare de singulis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   non erit invtile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et tantum de isto dubio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext von Teil II: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic iubet ordo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quos ego cerno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar zu Teil II: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ista est 2}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 a}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 pars magistri Allexandri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed relacio intrinseca non sit parum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et ista sufficiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Federproben und Notae von verschiedenen Schreibern (Namensnennung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lienhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), u. a.  grammatikalische Notae von der Hand Aichers: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item gerundia in di, in do, in dum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   suppinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer bis auf drei Federproben mit dem Spruch: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 omnibus hoc dico: miser est qui seruit iniquo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   ((= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 20136).
