\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat7 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Seneca de 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   virtutibus cardinalibus etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q]vatuor virtutum species multorum sapientium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tercia continencia, quarta iusticia. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite und 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat7 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Edition: Martini episcopi Bracarensis opera omnia, ed. Claude W. \plain \f1\i\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barlow\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 . New Haven 1950 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Papers an monographs of the American Academy in Rome XII)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 , S. 237. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\i\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Henkel\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 , Schultexte (wie oben), S. 306-309.}

