\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vt flos grammatice pingatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... dant predicta cani duplex crux \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  crus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  korrigiert)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   duo naui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; der Text ist durchg\u228 \'e4ngig mit Interlinearglossen und Wortfolgeziffern f\u252 \'fcr den Schulgebrauch aufbereitet; (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 S]icut dicit philosophus in primo posteriorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : ad cognicionem cuiuslibet rei necesse est ... \endash ... que dicta sufficiunt ad presens, pro quo sit benedictus Marie filius in secula seculorum amen, et sic est finis 1473\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item finitus est iste tractatus videlicet autor modorum significandi }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (folgt Rasur, unter Quarzlampe sichtbar ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Narcissum Wag}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ...)}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  quinta feria ante festum sancti Ambrosij eximij doctoris {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [= 30. M\u228 \'e4rz 1473]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , et isto anno fuit in dominica scilicet in qua canit ecclesia judica me deus, anno domini M}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 CCCC}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 LXXIII}}\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .
