\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anicius Manlius Severinus Boethius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De consolatio philosophiae cum commento}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anicij Manlij Torquati Sepherini Boecij ordinarij patrici viri exconsulis de consolatione philosophie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Carmina qui quondam studio florente}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum ante oculos agitis iudiciis cuncta cernentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgt Rasur, sichtbar (Quarzlampe):\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   f \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  E M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praefatio zum Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut scribit philosophorum princeps Aristoteles egregius in primo ethicorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod felicitas est bonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tempore Anastasij imperatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui vixit anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   //; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Marginalglossen: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Volens ergo Becius agere de consolacione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod iudicatum esse non velle, sed nec hec videre verum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; der Text ist mit Interlinearglossen (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cantus delectabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Lemma: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  carmina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  euentus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Lemma: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  exitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) und gelegentlichen Wortfolgeziffern f\u252 \'fcr den Schulgebrauch aufbereitet.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition: CCL 94, ed. Ludwig \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bieler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1984); ed. Claudio Moreschini. M\u252 \'fcnchen 2005 (Bibliotheca Teubneriana). \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung des Kommentars: St. Gallen, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Ms 824}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Incipit fast identisch; vgl. Codices Boethiani. A conspectus of manuscripts of the works of Boethius. Bd. 2: Austria, Belgium, Denmark, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, Sweden, Switzerland, hrsg. von Lesley \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Smith\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . London/Turin 2001 (Warburg Institute surveys and texts 27), S. 203).}

