\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -289\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Boethius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De disciplina scolarium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Haupttext: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 V]estra nouit intencio de scolarium disciplina}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ultima vero alterius saporis inquinamenta permanebunt. Deo gratias 1469 >\u183 \'b7 E \u183 \'b7 M \u183 \'b7<}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar (Marginalglossen): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste est liber Bohecij de disciplina scolarium, cuius subiectum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   per antiquos expositores est debitus et distinctus modus procedenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  adhesit licet invitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Text durchg\u228 \'e4ngig mit Interlinearglossen und Wortfolgeziffern f\u252 \'fcr den Schulgebrauch aufbereitet; (289\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition (Haupttext): Pseudo-Bo\u232 \'e8ce: De disciplina scolarium, ed. Olga \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weijers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leiden 1976 (Studien und Texte zur Geistesgeschichte des Mittelalters 12), S. 93-134. \endash  Zum Kommentar vgl. ebd. S. 21 Nr. 8.}

