\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Haupttext: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Teobaldi de duodecim animalium naturis phizologus feliciter incipit. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tres leo naturas tres habet inde figuras}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quos nunc defendat, qui secla per omnia regnat. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Theobaldi de duodecim animalium naturis phizologus finit feliciter \u183 \'b7 1471 \u183 \'b7 >per fratrem EM professum monasterij Sancti Emmerami<}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (327\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -339\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar (Marginalglossen): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste liber, qui phizologus duodecim naturis animalium intitulatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  breuissime in duas diuiditur partes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ille draco sew serpens antiquus interficitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  siue cruciatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a cuius insidijs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nos custodiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui benedictus est per secula seculorum amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; vollst\u228 \'e4ndiger Text des \u8218 \'82Physiologus\lquote , mit Interlinearglossen und Wortfolgeziffern f\u252 \'fcr den Schulgebrauch aufbereitet.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
