\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C]onueniunt subito cuncti de montibus altis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  salue dulce decus cucule per secula salue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finit Ouidius de cuculo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Alcuini Carmina, ed. Ernst \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 mmler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , MGH Poetae 1 (1881), S. 270-272 Nr.LVIII; Anthologia latina. Bd. 1: Carmina in codicibus scripta, ed. Alexander \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Riese\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leipzig 1869 (Bibliotheca Teubneriana), Nr. 687, S. 145-148; Seven versions of Carolingian pastoral, ed. Roger P. H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Green\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Reading 1980 (Reading university medieval and Renaissance Latin Texts 3), S. 9f., 46-51 (dort auch zur Verfasserfrage); textkritische Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen bei John I. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Enerney\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Alcuin, Carmen 58, in: Mittellateinisches Jahrbuch 16 (1981), S. 35-42. \endash  Vgl. ferner Peter \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Godman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Poetry of the Carolingian Renaissance, London 1985, S. 20f. und 144-149. \endash  Vgl. Clavis Galliae 2, S. 69-73 ALC 11.58; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia carminum 3288; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schaller/K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 nsgen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (mit Supplement) 2750.}

