\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u220 \'dcberschrift auf 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex collacione tercia Thome abbatis de corpore Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nec tamen ex eo debemus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aut ociosa obliuione depereunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Johannes Cassianus, Conlatio XXIII c. 21; Ed.: CSEL 13, ed. Michael \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Petschenig\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / Gottfried \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kreuz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2004), S. 670f.); (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctus Cyprianus dicit: Eukaristia cottidie ad cibum salutis accipitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Cyprianus, De dominica oratione c. 18; Ed.: CCL 3A, ed. Claudio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Moreschini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1976), S. 101); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ambrosius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si quocienscumque effunditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Ambrosius Mediolanensis, De sacramentis IV 6, 28; Ed.: CSEL 73, ed. Christopher Otto \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Faller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1956), S. 58); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hylarius episcopus dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si tanta non sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Isidorus Hispalensis, De ecclesiasticis officiis 1, 18; Ed.: CCL 113, ed. Christopher M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lawson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1984), S. 21f.); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ieronimus in epistola ad Lucinum: Eukaristiam quoque absque condemnacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  leges apostolicas arbitretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Hieronymus, Epistula ad Lucinum Baeticum c. 6; Ed.: CSEL \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  55, ed. Isidor \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hilberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1996), S. 7); (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De oblatione defunctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quidnam ergo esse potuerit quod mortuorum valeat animabus prodesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si culpe post mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fiat ipsa dampnatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Gregorius Magnus, Dialogi 4,57; Ed.: Fonti per la storia d\rquote Italia 57, ed. Umberto \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Moricca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1924), S. 315-318); (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exhortatoria optima Iohannis Constantinopolitani episcopi de penitencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O grandis misericordia dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ab operibus malis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Opera D. Ioannis Chrysostomi ... Bd. 1, Basel 1539 (VD 16 J 400), p. 479-486; hier nur Ausz\u252 \'fcge); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eodem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quia valde magnum bonum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et sincera conuersio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clm 14540}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; vgl. Catalogus IV,2,4, S. 524); (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius de reparacione lapsi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dilectissimo filio Secundino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui peccatores sa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [n]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gwine suo redimere venit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Edition: Raymund \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kottje\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Die Bu\u223 \'dfb\u252 \'fccher Halitgars von Cambrai und des Hrabanus Maurus. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1980 (Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte und Quellenkunde des Mittelalters 8), S. 280-282 Beilage III); (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ysidorus de reparatione lapsi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Domino sancto meritisque beato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratri Mansioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  siue pristine dignitatis recipiet meritum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 83, 899-901).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
