\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Psalmorum grece, nabulum hebraice, organum latine}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In cordis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ps 150,4): (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in fidibus uel in instrumento quod habet cordas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgen Merkverse zu den Psalmen: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Numerus psalmorum habetur in hijs versibus: Ter quinquagenos Dauid canit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 19209) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est finis ipsius psalterij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgt Anhang mit Erkl\u228 \'e4rungen zu den biblischen Cantica: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et omnia sequencia cantica sunt addita}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Confitebor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hoc est canticum Ysaie prophetae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia sunt sumpta ex textu ewangelij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgen kurze Erl\u228 \'e4uterungen zum Vaterunser und zum athanasischen Symbol: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pater noster: hec est oratio dominica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quicumque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hoc canticum fecit Athanasius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui regnat trinus et vnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
