\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tituli psalmorum quos antiqui posuerunt in psalterijs suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Beatus vir qui non in consilio ... (Ps 1,1). Quidam putant hunc psalmum composuisse Ioseph}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ab Aromathia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et a quibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quia ab omni spiritu. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgen kanonistische notae in kursiverer Schrift: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota, quod communicas excommunicato}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro temeraria iniectione manuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  // (Rest getilgt).}

