\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u220 \'dcberschrift auf 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secuntur dicta reuerendi doctoris Saltonis contra presbyteros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primum dictum meum est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 quod quicumque presbiteri suspensi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  excommunicati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  interdicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  depositi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et mulieres ammoueant non amplius illas admissuri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Hier Zuschreibung an Konrad von Soltau.
