\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit dictum Richardi de peccatis cogitationis delectacionis et consensus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 notandum secundum magistrum sententiarum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in libro 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   distinctione 24\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod sensualitas est quedam vis anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Racio vero est vis anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Petrus Lombardus, Liber sententiarum 2, dist. 24, c. 4-12; Ed.: Petri Lombardi Libri IV Sententiarum. Bd. 2, Quaracchi \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1916, S. 421-426) ... (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et ideo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ut dicit Richardus in libro de XII patriarchis capitulo 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si ymaginacionis euagatio que fit per inutiles cogitaciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= Richardus de Sancto Victore, Benjamin minor, c. 27; Ed.: PL 196, 1-64, hierzu Sp. 19) ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod consensus in delectacionem mortalis peccati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est peccatum mortale etc. Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

