\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Auf 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   nur \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In factis Turcorum copia missa ad reges et principes Romanorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fridericus diuina fauente clemencia Romanorum imperator ... Quantum dedecoris, quantumcumque detrimenti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  suorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scelerum penas luat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Datum in Nova Ciuitate die nona mensis Ianuarij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  imperij nostri anno secundo 1454\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  regni 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= Wiener Neustadt, 9. Januar 1454).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Edition: RTA 19,1 (1969), S. 96-100 Nr. 14/2.}

