\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. XVIIIA: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hieronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (am oberen Rand nachgetragen). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In anno, quo mortuus est Ozias rex ui[di] dominum sedentem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mundabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Is 6,1-7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hucusque historia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic Ozias rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sicut in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Regnorum libris legimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iustus fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. XVIIIB: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  LXX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= Septuaginta). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et missum est ad me unum de seraphin (Is 6,6). Aquila et Theodotion}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et propterea scriptum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Temptatio est uita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Iob 7,1).
