\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XIIII,1, 10-14: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Temporibus Gothorum fuit iuxta Spolitanam urbem uir uitae}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   uenerabilis Isaac nomine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui multis claruit miraculis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic itaque cum uirtute abstinentiae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XV,2, 9, 10, 13-17, 8: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In Nursia prouintia duo uiri}}\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17  in sanctitatis vit\u281 \'ea {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 degentes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  intorqueri ultra presumpserit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iaculum maledictionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite leer; Passage nach c. XV,2 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) stark verk\u252 \'fcrzt und paraphrasiert.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition: Gr\u233 \'e9goire le Grand: Dialogues, ed. Adalbert de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vog\u252 \'fc\u233 \'e9 /\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Paul \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Antin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . T. II. Paris 1979 (Sources chr\u233 \'e9tiennes 260), S. 302,1-3, 311-314, 320-326. \u8210 ? CPL 1713. }

