\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Exzerpte aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moralia in Iob, libri XXIII\u8210 ?XXV}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Beginnt mit Exzerpt aus der Oratio Gregorii papae ad plebem: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  MOGLIRAREAGR\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  GR\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   mit K\u252 \'fcrzungsstrich = Moralia Gregorii). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Citius igitur ad precem iudex flectitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non uult irasci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; liber XXIII, 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Unde hoc quoque caute pensandum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; endet in liber XXV, 11: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nequius est odisse iustitiam quam non fecisse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpt aus Beda Venerabilis, In epistulas septem catholicas (In epistulam I Petri, III,18); (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) danach Texteinschub: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tribus in quodam loco apostolus nos hortatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  similes ei erimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) weiterer Einschub: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Propheta namque dicit: Perdidisti omnes, qui fornicantur abs te}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (Ps 72,27)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  plus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aliquid delectat quam deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .      
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
