\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber III c. XVI: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De mysticis loquutionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic si flagitium aut facinus uidetur iubere}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut peccatum eius non suscipias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Id est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut peccatum peccatori tibi adquiras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (tiron.); (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber II c. XVI,25: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De numerorum imperitia quae multa facit non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  intellegi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Numerorum etiam imperitia multa facit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hoc est xl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= quadraginta) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diebus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ieiunare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quinquagenarius uero numerus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  si quaeritur potest legem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sed his\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tribus adhuc quartus additur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id est sub pace\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (tiron.); (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber III c. III: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quomodo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  distinguendum sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quis accusabit aduersus electos dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Credimus enim deum non accusaturum aduersus electos suos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut ubique tacite respondeatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (tiron.).    
