\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 XXXV, 15-17: SEPDENANURI METIORO (= De septinario numero). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Trium amicorum Iob, qui etiam hereticorum typum tenent superbientium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  haec eorum superbia septem sacrificiis expiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Septinarius autem numerus apud sapientes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Texteinschub: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nam quid est quod Hiericho non pugnando sed septies girando ruitur?}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et illi gratias in omnibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  agat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Fortsetzung in XXXV, 17-18: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod uero per septinario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  numerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qua excisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fuerant adgregentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (tiron.). 
