\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Duo nomina hunc appellare conuenit libellum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui dixit uado parare uobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  locum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iesus Christus dominus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et ecce uobiscum sum usque ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consummationem saeculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cui est laus uirtus imperium in secula saeculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpt aus Alcuinus, De animae ratione ad Eulaliam virginem, c. III-IV: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De quatuor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  virtvtibvs cardinalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quattuor namque in hominibus [\u252 \'fcber getilgtem anibus] iustis manifestum est. Id est, prudentia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nisi pro amore dei fortiter omnia tolerare aduersa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ideo tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\u252 \'fcber der Zeile] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  has quatuor uirtutes exposuimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia sine illis anima tua deo adherere non potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; es folgen drei Verse (Alcuini carmen LVI/II): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Mitis ab aetherio [L\u252 \'fccke durch Rasur] clementer Christus Olimpho}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \u8230 \'85; anschlie\u223 \'dfend Zitat aus Alcuinus, De animae ratione ad Eulaliam virginem, c. I: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Albinus magister ait\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quantum enim quisque deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\u252 \'fcber der Zeile] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  agnoscit in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tantum diligit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui minus agnoscit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  minus diligit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
