\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ivo Carnotensis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistula ad Pontium Cluniacensem (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ivo gratia [\u252 \'fcber der Zeile] dei Carnotensis aeclesi\u281 e minister Pontio uenerabili Cluniacensis in abbatie regimine sibi commisso placere summo rectori}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quesiuit a paruitate mea prudens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diligentia et diligens prudentia uestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non respuens si quis de his altiora et sacratiora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ex auctoritate uel diuina inspiratione dicere uoluerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite und 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: PL 162, 233-234C Nr. CCXXXI (231). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

