\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Beginnt mit Exzerpt aus Amalarius Mettensis, Liber officialis III, 5: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De introitu episcopi ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  missam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Introitvs episcopi ad missam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 qui uicarius est Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; enth\u228 \'e4lt daneben Exzerpte aus Eclogae de ordine romano (Beginn mit c. III, VI >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De episcopo iam presentato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <, VII usw.); (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Amalarius, Liber officialis III, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 13, 15, 16, 17\u8230 \'85 (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpt aus Isidorus Hispalensis, De ecclesiasticis officiis II, 8: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ysidorvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nam sicut in sacerdote consecratio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  castitatis splendeant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit de presentia corporalis et calicis Ysidorvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; Exzerpte aus Eclogae de ordine romano c. XIX, XX; (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Isidorus Hispalensis, De ecclesiasticis officiis I, 14 und (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) I, 18 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ysidorvs de evcharistia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; Exzerpt aus Amalarius, Liber officialis III, 19 (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpt aus Walahfridus Strabo, De exordiis et incrementis quarundam in observationibus ecclesiasticis rerum, c. 25: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sacris vasis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; Amalarius, Liber officialis III, 21; Exzerpt aus Eclogae de ordine romano, c. XXIII; (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Amalarius III, 24, 27; endet mit einem Exzerpt aus Maximus Taurinensis, Sermo I,1: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diuitias inmortalitatis ille dispensat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 scienti\u281 \'ea thesauros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iste largitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .         
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition/Druck: Exzerpte aus dem Liber officialis III in Amalarii episcopi opera II (wie oben), S. 271ff.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (ab Z. 18); Eclogae de ordine romano in Amalarii episcopi opera III (wie oben), S. 232ff.; Zitate aus Isidor in CCL 113, ed. Christopher M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lawson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (1989), S. 16, 21,63-72, 67,36-68,50; Exzerpt aus Walahfridus Strabo in MGH Capit. 2, S. 503-504,4; PL 114, 951-952A (c. XXIV); Stelle aus Maximus Taurinensis in CCL 23, ed. Almut \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mutzenbecher\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (1962), S. 2,12-20.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     }

