\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Leonardus de Datis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quadragesimale de flagellis peccatorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit quadragesimale de flagellis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Acceperunt mercedem suam}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... (vgl. Mt. 6,2). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Da}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 domine}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 mercedem sustinentibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In die pasceuen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Inclinato capite tradit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Io 19,30). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et est sententia psalmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circumdederunt me dolores mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vitam eternam nobis tribuere dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Alphabetisches Register der genannten S\u252 \'fcnden: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tabula super precedencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ambicio 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vindicta 48\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit quadragesimale de flagellis scriptum per me fratrem Petrum Jungwirt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et finitum in vigilia assumpcionis virginis gloriose anno LIIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 14. August 1454)<; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtrag eines knappen alphabetischen Stichwortregisters, 15. Jh., (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig: A bis E; Fortsetzung s. u. 237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tabula communium contentorum in precedenti quadragesimali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vtrum abstinencia valeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  subditus teneatur ad instituendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermone 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Druck: Leonardus de Utino (!), Sermones quadragesimales de flagellis peccatorum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Lyon 1518, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Reihenfolge der Predigten \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend, Text dieser Hs. oft verk\u252 \'fcrzt). \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Scriptores 3, 2838. \endash  Zum Autor vgl. Paolo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Viti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Dizionario biografico degli italiani 33 (1987), S. 44. \endash  Vgl. ferner \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2011), S. 2738; Federico \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Contini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: BISLAM 2 (2010), S. 1279.}

