\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequuntur collecta ex prima parte s. Thomae de anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus dicit in 6to de trinitate: anima simplex dicitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Summa Theologiae I, q. 75, a. 1) ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et homo dicitur ymago dei propter ydemptitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sillogismum hoc Tho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prima parte q. XCIII ar. I. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Summa Theologiae I, q. 93, a. 1).
