\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini Iesu Christi incipiunt interrogaciones que de scripturis sanctis et canonibus sacris in foro penitentie ad utilitatem conficiencium fieri possunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 si episcopus non est baptizatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vnusquisque sicut viderit expedire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgen Verse \u8218 \'82De casibus reservatis episcopis\lquote : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Incestum faciens deflorens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  egerque senectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
