\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Herolt}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones discipuli de tempore (selectio cum paucis sermonibus additis)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Auf 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   oben rechts (beschnitten): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; die ersten 20 Predigten auf den Recto-Seiten oben rechts in r\u246 \'f6mischen Ziffern durchgez\u228 \'e4hlt; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecce rex tuus venit ... (Mt 21,5). Ad honorem dei, beate virginis Marie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et omni sanctorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Sermones I, III, VII, IX, XI, XII, XVII, XIX, XXI, XXIII, XXV, XXVI, XXVII): (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Filii autem regni eijciantur ... (Mt 8,12). Ex quo hic fit mencio de penis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dampnatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Text z. T. wie Sermo CXXV, Thema und Anfang vgl. Anhang zu Sermo XXVIII, S. 164); (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones XXIX, XXX); (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Voca operarios ... (Mt 20,8). Scire debetis in Christo dilectissimi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Text z. T. \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit Sermo XXXII, Thema abweichend); (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones XXXIV, XXXVII, XXXVIII, XXXIX; (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Miserere mei fili Dauid ... (Mt 15,22). Ex quo iam presens est tempus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Sermo nicht nachweisbar); (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones XLII, XLII; folgt Schreibervermerk: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scriptum die S. Blasij M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   etc. LXX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   per me Henri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hoppf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (enstat); (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo XLV; Rest der Seite und 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer; (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones XLVI, XLVII; 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer; (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones XLVIII, L, LI, LVI, LIX, LX, LXII, LXIV, LXVI, LXVIII, LXX, LXXIII, LXXV, LXXVIII, LXXXI, LXXXIV, LXXXVII, XC, XCII, XCV; auf 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Indulgenzenverzeichnis der P\u228 \'e4pste Urban VI., Martin V. und Eugen IV.; (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones XCVII, C, CIIII, CV, CVII, CVIII; Rest der Seite und 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer; (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo CXLVIII); (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Surge et vade ... (Lc 17,19). Notandum quod dominus Iesus Christus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   per veram contricionem peccatori peccata dimittit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Text weitestgehend nach Sermo CXLVI und CXLVII, Thema abweichend); (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo CXIII; Rest der Seite und 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer. (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In uisitatione virginis benedicte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exurgens Maria ... (Lc 1,39). In illo ewangelio tria principaliter exponentur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Initium \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit Iohannes Nider, Sermo de septem gaudiis et doloribus Mariae; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schneyer/H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dl, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rep.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1350-1500\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones CLVIII, CLIX. (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Modicum laboraui et inueni {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... (Sir 51,35). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commendatur hic fidelis a duobus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hunc sermonem celeri manu collegi omnium sanctorum die anno etc. LXVI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 1. November 1466; Sermo nicht nachweisbar); (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Queritur, vtrum statim post mortem hominis anima eius iudicetur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scribitur die S. Martini anno etc. LXVI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 11. November 1466; Sermo nicht nachweisbar); (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones CLX, CXXX; (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Domenica XXIII de nouem alienis peccatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sermo 64\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pharisei consilium inierunt ... (Mt 22,15). Matthaeus dicit, quod non potuerunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eum capere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Sermo nicht nachweisbar); (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones CXXXIV, CXXXVI; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  finiui ego magister Hein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ricus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hoppf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (enstat) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro tunc tempore plebanus in Lenting presens manuale sermonum discipuli de tempore die Saturni XXIX Augusti anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo sexagesimo septimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= 29. August 1467)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   pro quo sit deo laus graciarum accio etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; Rest der Seite und 171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer; (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo CXV; auf 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   am Rand oben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominica XVI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica XVII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de septem peccatis mortalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sermo 58\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Homo quidam ydropicus}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... (Lc 14,2). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ita scribitur Luce 14}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Christus in sabbato}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   docebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; z. T. \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit Sermo CXVII, Thema wie Sermo CXVIII; (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica XVIII de decem preceptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sermo 59\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In hiis duobus mandatis ... (Mt 22,40). Verba proposita Matthaeus 22 originaliter}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sunt scripta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; Text z. T. \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit Sermo CXLIII, Thema und Anfang vgl. Anhang zu Sermo CXXI, S. 687; (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones CXXII, CXLIX, CXXVII\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Scriptum die Iouis VIII marcij anno etc. LXX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   per magistrum Hein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ricum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hoppfenstatt pro tempore plebanus in Lenting\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) folgt Nachtrag (Zitatensammlung): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota de animabus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Celestinus papa in sermone: Qui nunc hiis, qui in penis sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  auxilium transmittit animabus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  refrigerio et sapore etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    leer.
