\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cronaca \u8222 \'84A latina\ldblquote }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit cronica compilata per illustrissimum dominum dominum Andream Dandulo inclitum Veneciarum ducem etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< (dar\u252 \'fcber am oberen Blattrand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine patris et filij et spiritus sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einleitung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Predecessorum nostrorum auctoritate testante equidem ante constitutionem vrbis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Veneciarum presentis altera Venecia fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sub compendio declarabo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paulucius anno incarnacionis domini 68 primus ad ducalem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dignitatemque nobilium et popularum vnanimi voluntate in ciuitate Eracliana honorifice fuit promotus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  debitum nature\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  persoluens fuit in ecclesia sancti Marci sub porticu tumulatus cum maxima reuerencia et honore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit cronica compendiose et elleganter edita per serenissimum dominum dominum Andream Dandulo inclitum Veneciarum ducem etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Cronaca \u8222 \'84A latina\ldblquote . Cronaca veneziana del 1343, ed. Caterina \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Negri di Montenegro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Spoleto 2004 (Quaderni della Rivista di Bizantinistica 2), S. 33-155 (diese Hs. = Sigle C). \endash  Der Text galt in der Forschung lange Zeit als \u8222 \'84Recensio B\ldblquote  der Chronica des Andrea Dandolo; vgl. die Einleitung zu Andreae Danduli Chronica per extensum descripta, ed. Ester \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pastorello\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bologna 1938-1958 (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Rerum Italicarum Scriptores 12/1), S. 333-336; vgl. dazu auch Antonio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Carile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La cronachistica veneziana (secoli XIII-XVI) di fronte alla spartizione della Romania nel 1204. Florenz 1969 (Civilt\u224 \'e0 veneziana. Studi 25), S. 3-7 (diese Hs. = Sigle Mon.).}

