\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De eo quod res est vel non est oratio vera vel falsa dicitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sed a dictionibus sincathegreumatibus ut sunt tantum, solum, preter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  subiectum proporcionatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scilicet motus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Spalte und 189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
