\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Auszug aus Kommentar:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dubita vtrum sacerdos pollutus pollucione nocturnali die sequenti possit celebrare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... dubitatur et ponatur casus, quod aliquis arripiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec Raymundus in suis summulis de sacramentis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Beginn des Haupttextes: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qualiter collecte sunt dicende. In summis festis ad missam dicitur vna}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per dominum dic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; folgt Zitat: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus dicit: Qui bene docet et male facit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (nicht nachweisbar).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Druck: GW 213 = BSB-Ink A-21. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia carminum 9117. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ, S. 427f.; Franz Joseph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 1 (1978), 47-50; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2011), S. 23f.; Simona \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Polidori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: CALMA 1 (2000), S. 20.}

