\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ars praedicandi et instructiones pro sacerdotibus (lat. und dt.)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota aliqua pro iuueni sacerdote apta necnon pro modo sermocinandi abilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primo dic verbum \u8218 \'82amen\lquote , post hec propone thema ... Der frid des alm\u228 \'e4chtigen gotz}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  zu hillf vnd zu trost ein pater noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aue Maria sprecht etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge mit weiteren seelsorgerischen Notizen: (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps.-Bonaventura, Tabula de considerandis a missam celebranturis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hoc opus frater Bonaventura cardinalis dicitur composuisse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in quo informat et admonet omnes sacerdotes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (mit Baumschema; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bonaventurae scripta, S. 200 Nr. 225); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si quis ad altare digne cupias celebrare}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 17901); (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schema zu den Horae canonicae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vt hore canonice debite persoluantur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota significationes misticas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et morales vestimentorum sacerdotalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vestimentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quo Pilatus Christum illusit Ioh. XX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  veste purpurea circumdederunt eum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Io 19,2).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Charland\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Artes praedicandi S. 102. }

