\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit tractatus decem preceptorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Audi, Israel, precepta domini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est vnus deus laudabilis ac benedictus in seculorum secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rescripta sunt hec in Wei(n)t(i)nk (?) anno 66to et terminata in die S. Virgilij episcopi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= Burgweinting (?), 27. November 1466); 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
