\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De secretis mulierum cum commento}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praefatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Teste philosopho 8o ethicorum homo est optimum eorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   que sunt in mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum vtilitate etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dilecto sibi in Christo socio et amico carissimo Nicolao clerico Erfordie}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  auxilium implorans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a quo omnis sapientia orta est et vita eterna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste libellus, cuius subiectum est ens mobile contractum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ad materiam secretorum mulierum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vbi gaudium perpetuum vbique omnium sanctorum leticia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad quod nos perducat Iesus Christus in secula seculorum benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et est finis huius opusculi 1465 in die sancti Blasij}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 3. Februar 1465); Rest der Seite und 234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition: El \u8222 \'84De secretis mulierum\ldblquote  atribuido a Alberto Magno. Estudio, edici\u243 \'f3n cr\u237 \'edtica y traducci\u243 \'f3n, ed. Jos\u233 \'e9 Pablo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barrag\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 n Nieto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Porto 2012 (Textes et \u233 \'e9tudes du Moyen \u194 \'c2ge 63), S. 214-532, zu dieser Hs. vgl. S. 117, zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung des Kommentars S. 538f. \endash  Zum Text vgl. Margaret \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schleissner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 8 (1990), Sp. 986-994, hierzu Sp. 988.}

