\par \pard\li0\fi0\jclisttab\tx0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 \tab}\ls2\ilvl1 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Lyra}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Postilla litteralis super epistulam Pauli ad Hebraeos (Prol.-1)}}
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 \tab}\ls2\ilvl1 \plain \f0\fs24 
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 \tab}\ls2\ilvl1 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prologus in epistulam ad Hebreos / Lira\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , darunter erneut: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prologus in epistulam ad Hebreos Lire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum venerit quod perfectum est ... (I Cor 13,10). In primitiua ecclesia illi qui de iudaismo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   conuertebantur ad fidem Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia materia est nimis longa etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; folgt Zitat aus den Questiones super libros Ethicorum Aristotelis des Johannes Versor: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota ultima et perfecta hominis felicitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quousque diuinam essentiam videat ergo etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (GW M50233 = u.a. BSB-Ink V-167, hierzu Bl. 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); folgt nachgetragen Aristoteles-Zitat: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Philosophus 7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ethicorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non est mirabile \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ..., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  si quis a fortibus delectationibus vincitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= Ethica Nicomachea VII,7,8 (50b6), vgl. Aristoteles latinus XXVI (1974), S. 507).
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: GW M26538 = u.a. BSB-Ink N-111; mit vielen Abweichungen. \endash  Zur Druck\u252 \'fcberlieferung vgl. Edward A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gosselin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A listing of printed editions of Nicolaus de Lyra, in: Traditio 26 (1970), S. 399-426, hierzu S. 408-411. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   RB 5, 5915.}

