\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prologus bonus Gregorii Pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qvi textum historie beati Iob considerat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non fuissent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer. (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secuntur quedam collecta ex moralibus beati Gregorii pape super Iob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Inter multos sepe queritur, quis libri beati Iob scriptor habeatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sue rectitudine non incuruatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et hec de primo 1465 in vigilia Petri et Pauli}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 28. Juni 1465).
