\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cantica canticorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Osculetur me osculo ... (Ct 1,1). Ad euidentiam huius libri, qui cantica}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   canticorum nunccupatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quantum ad sensum literalem est sciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in hoc coequari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et sic est finis Iorum canticorum anno domini 1466 in opido Peyreut, scriptum per dominum Conr(adum) Zickel. Brevis omnis malicia super maliciam mulieris. Ecclesiastici 25 capitulo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Sir 25,26); 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
