\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Accessus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ante textus accessum aliqua pro meliori intellectu sunt videnda}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quorum primum est causa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  postea ostendit veram solucionem quam racionibus confirmat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Que et multa alia patebunt in processu etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anicij Mandlij Torquati Seuerini Boecij ordinarij patricij viri exconsulis liber primus de consolacione philosophie incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Carmina qui quandam (!) studio florente}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum ante oculos agitis iudicis cuncta cernentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finit Boecius \u183 \'b71\u183 \'b75\u183 \'b716. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar (Marginalglossen): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste est primus liber Boecij in quo conqueritur se miserijs subiectum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et diuiditur in tredecim partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... [zu 4,I,9: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sunt etenim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hoc primo metro B. ostendit viam per quam peruenitur ad cognicionem summi boni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a pede predominante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; dazu Interlinearglossen zum besseren Textverst\u228 \'e4ndnis, als \u220 \'dcbersetzungshilfen und Wortschatz\u252 \'fcbungen; 265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: CCL 94, ed. Ludwig \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bieler \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1984), S. 1-106; Boethius: De consolatione philosophiae. Opuscula theologica, ed. Claudio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Moreschini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . M\u252 \'fcnchen/Leipzig \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2005 (Bibliotheca Teubneriana), S. 3-161. \endash  CPL 878. \endash  Der Accessus basiert auf dem Boethius-Kommentar des Guillelmus Wheatley; vgl.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Guillelmus Wheatley, In Boethii De consolatione Philosophiae, in: S. Thomae Aquinatis opera omnia. Bd. 7: Aliorum medii aevi auctorum scripta 61, ed. Roberto \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Busa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Stuttgart-Bad Cannstatt 1980, S. 121-172, hierzu S. 122. }

