\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnologia nocturna de sanctis secundum chorum ecclesie diui Emerammi martyris ordinis S. Benedicti. In nomine domini incipit fauste. Et primum de sancto Andrea apostolo ad matutinum invitatorium.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Adoremus victoriosissimum regem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (CAO 1019) \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aput tuam misericordiam defensorem habeamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Offizien (Lectiones, Orationes, Antiphona, Homilien, Hymnen) von Andreas (30. November) bis Ambrosius (4. April), vollst\u228 \'e4ndig aufgef\u252 \'fchrt nur Hymnus des Hl. Stephan: (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[27].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stephano primo martiri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 14 Nr. 13), restliche Hymnen nur durch jeweiliges Anfangswort gekennzeichnet; 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Offizien des Osterkreises: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnologia nocturna communis de sanctis tempore paschali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Alleluia. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[25].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Regem apostolorum martyrum confessorum domini venite adoremus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed opus officii non implemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tu autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Offizien vom Fest der heiligen M\u228 \'e4rtyrer Vitus, Modestus und Crescentia (15. Juni) bis zur Translatio S. Dionysii (4. Dezember); vollst\u228 \'e4ndig zitierte Hymnen im Einzelnen: (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In commemoracione diui patris nostri Benedicti...< ... >Hymnus< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus tuorum militum spes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (AH 4 Nr. 189; nach dieser Hs.); (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Mari\u281 \'ea Magdalen\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[32].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Votiua cunctis orbita}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 51 Nr. 175); (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In transfiguratione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[22].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O sator rerum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   reparator eui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 51 Nr. 98); (184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 In dedicacione sacr\u281 \'ea ecclesi\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Christe cunctorum dominator}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 51 Nr. 103); (191\plain \f1\super\lang10