communis de vno martire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[19].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Martir dei qui vnicum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 51 Nr. 113); (255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnologia nocturna de sacris virginibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[30].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Virginis proles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 51 Nr. 121); (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Post octauas epiphani\u281 \'ea vsque ad purificacionem beate Mari\u281 \'ea virginis hoc modo de veneracione eius obseruatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Agnoscat omne seculum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 50 Nr. 71, Strophe 1-4);
