\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Seneca de qvatvor virtvtibvs cardinalibvs. Ne excordem uiuas uitas.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Vita Senecas: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Seneca Cordubensis philosophus vir doctissimus, Stratini Stoici discipulus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro pietate tulit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit Liber Lucij Annei Senec\u230 \'e6 de formula honest\u230 \'e6 uit\u230 \'e6, uel de quatuor virtutibus cardinalibus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qvatuor virtutum species multorum sapientum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nil opus esse sibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Harum autem etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Lemma): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Author reddit auditores attentos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  superbiam tuam etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition (Haupttext): Martini episcopi Bracarensis opera omnia, ed. Claude W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barlow\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . New Haven 1950 (Papers and monographs of the American Academy in Rome XII), S. 237-250. \endash  Die Seneca-Vita ist gedruckt u. a. in GW M41503, a\plain \f1\sub\lang1033\fs20 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (= BSB-Ink M-212). \endash  Kommentar (in der Hs. gek\u252 \'fcrzt): u. a. ebd. \endash  St. Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 14492}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 14738}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 az y D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 az\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Index, S. 9f. Nr. 27; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   4457; CPPM 2B, 3480; CPL 1080.}

