\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit Bidascolicon \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De tribus rerum subsistentiis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tribus modis res subsistere habent}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad actum rerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praefatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Multi sunt quos ipsos adeo natura ingenio destitutos reliquit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quoque pars finem accipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit prohemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnium expetendorum prima est sapientia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sine animalibus cenam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber didascalicon magistri Hugonis \u183 \'b7 Laus deo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <
