\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec verba sancti patris Benedicti recepta sunt in fine regule sue}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quam ipse proprijs manibus scripsit et sancto Mauricio cum eum ad Gallias mitteret tradidit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Que sanctus Hugo venerabilis abbas cum aput maius monasterium Turonis in eadem regula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit qualiter in monasterio a fratribus regulariter religiose ac studiose conuersari et domino militari oporteat id ipsum cottidie repetendo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In primis cum nocturnis horis ad opus diuinum de lecto surrexerit frater}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  roget ponere custodiam ori suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Amen. 1519\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Rest der Spalte und 298\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition: Memoriale qualiter, ed. Claudius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Morgand\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Corpus Consuetudinum Monasticarum, hrsg. von Kassius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hallinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 1: Initia consuetudinis Benedictinae. Consuetudines saeculi octavi et noni, Siegburg 1963, S. 229-261, mit einigen Abweichungen; zu dieser Hs. (= Appendix Nr. 5) vgl. S. 218f. }

