\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Antiphona de beata Maria virgine ante primas quotidie dicenda.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sancta Maria succurre miseris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (CAO 4703) ... \endash ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ab octaua natalis domini vsque purificacionis oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus qui salutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 etern\u281 \'ea beat\u281 \'ea Mari\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  suscipere Christum dominum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

