\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Soliloquia ad diurnam hymnologiam requisita et feria secunda per totum annum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad primas psalmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Beatus vir qui non abiit ... (Ps 1,1)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash ... (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sabbato oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exaudi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   nos misericors deus ... per dominum nostrum Iesum Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Tagesoffizien mit Hymni de tempore communes; die Hymnen (jeweils mit Angabe von Vers- bzw. Strophenform in der \u220 \'dcberschrift) im Einzelnen: (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad primas hymnus iambicus dimeter archilochius monocolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tretrastrophus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iam lucis orto sidere}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 51 Nr. 41); (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad tercias hymnus iambicus dimeter ut supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nunc sancte nobis spiritus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 50 Nr. 18); (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad sextas hymnus iambicus dimeter etc. vt supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rector potens verax 