\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnologia diurna de sanctis in diem domini incipit et prima de sancto Andrea in primis vesperas capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Benedictio domini super caput iusti}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... (Prv 10,6)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Fabiano collecta alibi obmissa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pontificis Fabiani intercessio gloriosa nos perlegat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Heiligenoffizien; die Hymnen (jeweils mit Angabe von Vers- bzw. Strophenform in der \u220 \'dcberschrift) im Einzelnen: (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnus iambicus dimeter archilochius acathalecticus etc. vt supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Laus angelorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 51 Nr. 140); (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnus dactilius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  monocolus tristrophus ad vtrasque horas et laudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Plaudat leticia lux}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (AH 51 Nr. 181); (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymnus tricolus tetrastrophus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cuius primi duo versus choriambici tetrametri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\la