\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praefatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notandum quantum ad presens opusculum: ex versibus rubricatis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   siue cum rubrica scriptis habetur nomen libri quota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item in XV iussu redit etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext (jeweils nur Verso-Seite): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit biblia pauperum capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sex}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (dar\u252 \'fcber: }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 opera dierum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 prohibet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (dar\u252 \'fcber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fructum ligni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  peccauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) (dar\u252 \'fcber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Adam et Eva\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Agrippa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (dar\u252 \'fcber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  loquitur Paulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expliciunt capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (dar\u252 \'fcber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per fratrem Vlricum Peyrer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Zus\u228 \'e4tzliche Memorialverse (bis 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   nur auf Recto-Seite) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Genesis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Assunt sex opera. Bini vetant edere ligna}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad noua perge loca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bibe cum sponso uia sponso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: u. a. Biblia maxima versionum ex linguis orientalibus ..., ed. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 de la Haye\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Paris 1660, S. 1-10 (Interlinearglossen oft abweichend). \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia carminum 17610; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 1175-1182. \endash  Zum Text vgl. Christine \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wulf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 11 (2000), Sp. 59-61, hierzu Sp. 60 (Alexander de Villa Dei). \endash  Zur Zuschreibung an Alexander de Villa Dei vgl. Lucie \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dole\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u382 \'9e\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 alov\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Obscurity and memory in late medieval Latin manuscript culture. The case of the \u8222 \'84Summarium Biblie\ldblquote . Krems 2012 (Medium aevum quotidianum. Sonderband 29), S. 41f., 90f. und Anm. 222. \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dole\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u382 \'9e\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 alov\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Obscurity (wie oben), S. 158-167 (die Hs. genannt S. 163); zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung unter dem Titel \u8222 \'84Biblia pauperum\ldblquote  vgl. ebd. S. 45 Anm. 105. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung der zus\u228 \'e4tzlichen Memorialverse: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 14782}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

