\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Compendium metricum super decretum Gratiani (Carmen \u8218 \'82Aspice ius binum\lquote ) cum glossis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Erl\u228 \'e4uterung zur Benutzung der Memorialverse: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sciendum quod rubee}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  literae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (eingef\u252 \'fcgt) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in decreto alphabeti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  numerus questionum est anotatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aspice ius binum bene tunc species cape legum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Extunc ieiunia decreti pars tenet yma. Et sic est finis huius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar zu den ersten 50 Versen (i.d.R. jeweils \u252 \'fcber jedem Halbvers): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Duplex est ius scilicet diuinum et humanum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in vna prouincia non debent esse duo metropolitani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Ungedruckt. \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia carminum 1581. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung  von Einleitung und  Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 14782}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

