\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt capitula libri Genesi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De die primo in quo lux facta est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et venit de muliere sedente super bestiam et designatione eius. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Capitula zu folgenden biblischen B\u252 \'fcchern: (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gn, Ex, Lv, Nm, Dt, Ios, Idc; (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer; (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) I-II Mcc, Est, I-II Par, I Esr, Tb, Idt, I-IV Rg; 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Os (nur Schluss), Ioel, Am, Abd, Ion, Mi, Na, So, Agg, Za; Mal, I-II Mcc (wirklich doppelt), Mt, Mc, Lc, (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer, Lc (Rest), Io, Rm, I-II Cor, Gal, Eph, Col, I-II Th, I-II Tim, Tit, Phlm, Hbr, Iac, I-II Pt, I Io, Act, Apc; (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer; (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Auflistung der biblischen B\u252 \'fccher in 4 Spalten.
