\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones, notae, excerpta}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 ((I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Quaestiones:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Questio v(trum) antiquis patribus qui in inferno retinebantur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Petrus Lombardus, In epistolam ad Romanos, PL 191, 1363) ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  auxilium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod omni desideranti et petenti iuxtum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Notae: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota, quod iudex spiritualis non potest vnum propter delictum in alia dyocesi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (aus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   parrochia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  korrigiert)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   punire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Excerpta: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 B. Tho(mas) ii 2e q. 77 de empcionibus et vendicionibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ar. 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  trum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  possit aliquis plus vendere quam valeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quasi stipendium laboris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. Thomas de Aquino, Summa theologiae 2, 2, q. 77, a. 1-4).}

