\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Liber primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit prologus compendium theologice veritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Veritatis theologice sublimitas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex omnibus premissis collige quedam spectare gaudia solum ad animam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quedam ad corpus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quedam ad coniunctum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgt sp\u228 \'e4terer Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic patet finis compendij theologice veritatis Beati Thome de Aquino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; danach urspr\u252 \'fcngliche Explicit-Zeile: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Explicit compendium theologice veritatis scriptum per me Georgium Keilhaymer tunc temporis capellanum dominorum de Kameraw in Chambmunster Anno 1451 altera die sancte Lucie virginis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 14. Dezember 1451) ...; darunter Nachtrag: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et correctum anno 53 sabbato 7me}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 27. Januar 1453). (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Registrum, danach: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nomina 24\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   seniorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Samuel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dauid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
