\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Alius sermo in vigilia natalis Christi \u183 \'b71\u183 \'b74\u183 \'b79\u183 \'b77\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paruulus natus ... (Is 9,6). Sic spiritus sanctus qui omnium est artifex}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...;
