\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hermes Trismegistus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pimander (Translatio Marsilii Ficini)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Argumentum: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Argumentum Marsilii Ficini Florentini in librum Mercurii Trismegisti ad Cosimum Medicem patrie patrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Eo tempore, quo Moyses natus est, floruit Athlas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   diu patria viuat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (umgestellt). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finis argumenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mercurii Trismegisti liber de potestate et sapientia dei e greco in latinum traductus per Marsilium Ficinum ad Cosmum Medicem patrie patrem incipit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C]vm de rerum natura cogitarem ac mentis aciem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quibus omnia comprehenduntur. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Finit feliciter 1478 in profesto beati Luce ewangeliste (= 18. Oktober 1478). F(ecit) Erasmus Dawm}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \u214 \'d6sterreicher\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar vereinzelt am Rand und auf eingeschobenem Zettel zwischen Bl. 6 und 7: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et si non omnino fidei consonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  murmurans contra deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Mercurii Trismegisti Pimander, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Campanelli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (wie oben), S. 3-111, S. CXLVf. (Teiltranskription des Kommentartextes). \endash  Zur Druck\u252 \'fcberlieferung vgl. Karl H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dannenfeldt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Hermetica philosophica, in: Catalogus translationum et commentariorum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Mediaeval and Renaissance Latin translations and commentaries: annoted lists and guides, hrsg. von Paul Oskar \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kristeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 1, Washington 1960, S. 137-156, hierzu S. 138-140; Supplement: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kristeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: ebd., Bd. 2 (1971), S. 423.}

