\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ex epistolis familiaribus Caij Plinij aliqu\u230 \'e6 sentencie notatu perdign\u230 \'e6 feliciter incipiunt 1486 2a festa dominic\u230 \'e6 qua in eclesia (!) dei canitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= 9. April 1486) \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Misericordia domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \lquote ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ante Tiburcii et Valeriani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Frequenter hortatus es}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Contra vereor ne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   //; Textbestand: (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. I,1; (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. I,2; (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. I,4-6; (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. I,7,3-6; (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. I,8-16; (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. I,18,1-6; (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. I,19-20; (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. I,22-II,3,1-9; (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. II,4,2-6; (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. II,8-14; (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. II,16-III,19,4 (Textabbruch mitten im Satz).
