\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta ex Epistulis S. Ambrosii}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Collectiua excerpta ex epistolis ornati eloquii doctoris sancti Ambrosij Mediolanensium archipraesulis dignissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primum quippe scripsit tractatum insignem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad Vercellensem ecclesiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ambrosius seruus Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Confligor dolore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sine heresis temulentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgt Schreibersubskription mit Zeitenklage: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anno 1488 in profesto Barbare. 1488}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= 4. Dezember 1488). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O quam maxima discrimina versantur nunc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tu benigne Iesu id dissimulatum ibis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   1488\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus Ambrosii de ciclo pascali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Dominis fratribus dilectissimis ... Non mediocris esse sapienti\u281 \'ea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  maiestatem indiuiduam concinentes; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kalendarum Ianuariarum die anno 1489}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 1. Januar 1489); (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  locutus est dicens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si t\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  // Rest der Seite leer; Textbestand: Ep. extra coll. 14 (CSEL 82/3, S. 235-295); Ep. extra coll. 13 (CSEL 82/3, S. 222-234); Ep. lib. I-IV, 1-12,1 (CSEL 82/1, S. 3-92).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition: CSEL 82/3, ed. Michaela \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zelzer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (1982), S. 222-295; CSEL 82/1, ed. Otto \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Faller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (1968), S. 3-92. \endash  Schreibersubskription auf 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bischoff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , St. Emmeram im Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalter, S. 134.}

