\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Auszug (Anfang fehlt) aus dem Widmungsbrief des Omnibonus Leonicenus an Moyses Buffaroli, Bischof von Belluno, f\u252 \'fcr den Druck der Institutio oratoria, Venedig 1471 (GW M36818 = BSB-Ink Q-13 bzw. Nachdrucke): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Salutem plurimam dicit. Cum hanc michi prouinciam demandares}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cui me plurimum commendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpte aus Marcus Fabius Quintilianus, Institutio oratoria I,ep. dedicat.-I,5,1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Epistola Quintiliani. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Efflagitasti quottidiano conuicio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uitia quae sunt supradictis contra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  // [lies: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contraria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]; 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
