\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Konrad Celtis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Carmina (Excerpta)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fragmenta Conradi Celtis Protucii germanici poet\u230 \'e6 Laureati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Od. III,9: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Laudat Germanum inventorem artis impressorie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quid tantis strepitat Grecia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Od. II,16: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In vetulum poetrastrum et antiquum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cvm uultus tibi grandinosus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Od. II,4: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In eundem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bis denos memorant}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; Epigr. II,72: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex libros epigrammatum suorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De nummoso \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qeologo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sepe fidem celsa laudas nummose cathedra}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...; (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Epigr. II,79 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De Mustela\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Garrule, >rapofagam< curris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Od. II,17,1-75: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad Cumanum Athesinum iurisperitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Phebe, Cumano modulans}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Od. III,6: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad musam suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iam clara vatem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex libris carminum suorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< Od. II,11: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad Sixtum Tucher in laudes Norimberge Conradi Celtis carmen \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 parame\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!).< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sixti, Germanis modulante}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Od. III, 8: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Execratur Germanum inventorem bombarde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cuius pila pene traiectus fuisset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primus per auras}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; Od. II, 14: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad Andream Stiborium Theophum in iucunditatem vite consiliaque dei homini inquirenda non esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Musa Germanum stimulans}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Od. II,12: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad Berenardum Walkircum \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 pros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (lies: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prosphonetice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernarde priscis orte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; Od. III,4: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad Battum Minuncium in seculi luxum dehortatorie detestatur mercaturam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Batte, Rhenanis generatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anno salutis 1494 ipso die Marcelli}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 16. Januar 1494)<; (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Amores II,4,19-24: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hospicii, qui iura michi seruauit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; Epigr. I,67: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anser ad Almanos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Od. I,5,125-156: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sit michi victus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tempore letus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgt weiteres Epigramm: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quisquis adis nostram veniens peregrinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rite queat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bezold\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Freudeskreis (wie oben), Sp. 65).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Conrad Celtis, Oden/Epoden/Jahrhundertlied. Libri Odarum quattuor, cum Epodo et Saeculari Carmine (1513), ed. et transl. Eckart \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sch\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 fer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . T\u252 \'fcbingen 2008 (NeoLatina 16), S. 232 (Od. III,9), S. 162-164 (Od. II,16), S. 132 (Od. II,4), S. 164-168 (Od. II,17), S. 222-224 (Od. III,6), S. 148-150 (Od. II,11), S. 158-160 (Od. II,14), S. 152-154 (Od. II,12), S. 212-216 (Od. III,4), S. 56-58 (Od. I,5,125-156) (diese Hs. = Sigle C); F\u252 \'fcnf B\u252 \'fccher Epigramme von Konrad Celtes, ed. Karl \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hartfelder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Berlin 1881 (Nachdruck: Hildesheim 1963), S. 39 (Epigr. II,72), S. 41 (Epigr. II,79), S. 16 (Epigr. I,67); Conradus Celtis Protucius, Quattuor libri amorum / Germania generalis, ed. Felicitas \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pindter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leipzig 1934 (Bibliotheca scriptorum medii recentisque aevorum. Saecula XV-XVI), S. 34.
