\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Passionis Christi exposicio pronuncciata a quodam doctore Parisiensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ivstus perit et nemo est ... (Is 57,1). Hodie peregit sancta mater ecclesia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   diem passionis domini nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  regnum eternum cum ipso possidere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod nobis prestare dignetur ipse Iesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per omnia secula seculorum amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Explicit sermo passionis Christi per manus (!) Rudolphi Koburger tunc temporis dyaconi maioris ecclesie Ratisponensis anno etc. XLIII in vigilia sancte Affre martyris etc.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 6. August 1443).
