\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit epistula beati Eusebij ad beatum Damasum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Patri reuerendissimo Damasio ... >Post salutacionem incipit epistula Eusebij.< Multiphariam multisque modis olim deus locutus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gaudia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que iam possides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   addipisci.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit epistula beati Eusebij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur epistula venerabilis Augustini ad beatum Cyrillum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...<
