\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Chromatii et Heliodori epistula ad Hieronymum presbyterum et responsio eiusdem: (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit epistula episcoporum Chromacii et Eliodori at\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  beatum Ieronimum presbyterum de sancte Marie et de infancia Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dilectissimo fratri Ieronimo ... Ortum Marie virginis regine}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et ora pro nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Epistola Ieronimo prespiteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dominis ac venerabilibus episcopis ... Qui terra}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (! lies: terram) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  auri consciam fodit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  potuerunt per nostram obedienciam peruenire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit vita beate virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In diebus illis erat vir in Israel nomine Ioachim}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sicut euenit Pharaoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui glorabatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in fortitudine sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut nos omnes a mortis periculo liberaret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui cum deo patre et spiritu sancto viuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: CCA 9, ed. Jan \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gijsel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (1997), S. 279- 481 (Forma textus A, jedoch mit Abweichungen, v. a. am Schluss). \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 1, 168. \endash  Zu den Einleitungsbriefen vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lambert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , BHM 3A, 348 und 349 (S. 202 diese Hs. genannt); BHL 5334; CPL 633; CPPM 2A, 515 und 516.}

