\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sacerdotes (aus sacerdos korrigiert) de nouo celebraturi multa indigent circumspectione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vt glorificent patrem luminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui in celis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cui laus et honor in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) folgt Zusatz aus dem Decretum Gratiani: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epilogantur autem breuiter omnia predicta in canone Ysidori de vita clericorum ... Hijs igitur lege}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   patrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dum scientiae operam dant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  doctrine gratiam populis amministrent etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (= CICa, D. 22 c.3). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis huius operis imponendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<
