\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber qui vocatur viridarium consolacionis de vicijs et virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quoniam ut apostolus ait Petrus spiritu sancto affati locuti sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rectitudo sine peruersitate pulchritudo sine deformitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad quam nos perducat Ihesus Christus dei filius qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  regnat in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
