1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Petrus apostolus sedit Rome annis XXV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eugenius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anastasius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rogo autem te lector si tamen pro domina inuidia audeas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad gloriam est honorem perducet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit ymago mundi etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit ymago mundi etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<
