in \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Excerpta: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De prescientia dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Universas creaturas non ideo nouit deus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Augustinus, De trinitate 15,13; CCL 50A, ed. William J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mountain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1968), S. 495) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur de predestinacione et reprobatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Predestinacio ut tradit auctoritas est gracie preparatio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inuestigabiles uie illius etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Litania: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quicumque letaniam istam cottidie ... in honore gloriose virginis Marie legerit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   in peccatis mortalibus numquam morietur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Kyrieleyson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christeleyson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sancta Maria mater Christi sanctissima ora pro nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sancta Maria omnium regina per infinita secula ora pro nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgen Verse und Schlusswort: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Regine celi qui servit mente fideli}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 16519) \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Grata superueniet que non sperabitur hora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oratio bona de beata virgine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O pia domina et dulcissima ornamentum seculi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oratio pro inimicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O pater misericordiarum et deus tocius consolacionis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad ciuitatem gloriosam celestis patrie peruenire valeamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen etc. Oratio pro inimicis fusa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?).}

