\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistula synodalis concilii Basiliensis ad Hussitas (15. 10. 1431)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur tenor epistule misse ad boemos hereticos ex parte concilij Basiliensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sacrosancta Basiliensis synodus in spiritu sancto legittime congregata}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   vniuersalem ecclesiam representans viris ecclesiasticis nobilibus et toti populo regni Boemie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Compulit nos caritas Christi egredi de terra nostra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vitam eternam donare dignetur qui viuit benedictus in secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Datum Basilee die decima quinta mensis octobris anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo tricesimo primo ponitificatus ... Eugenij ... pape quarti anno primo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 15. Okt. 1431); folgt \u220 \'dcberschrift zum n\u228 \'e4chsten Text (auf 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   dann erneut): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber de conseruanda sanitate magistri Petri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Druck: Sacrorum conciliorum nova et amplissima collectio. Bd. 29, ed. Giovanni Domenico \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mansi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Venedig 1788, Sp. 233-236.}

