\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit decametus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vel decalogus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Accessus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Animoaduertendum (!) est circa principium istius libelli}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quemadmodum circa principia aliorum librorum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  donat in futuro seculo tristiciam sempiternam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qvi non transcendit mandata dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  totam seruanciam legem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Premisso prohemio autor ponit partem executiuam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancta Barbara sperigera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id est speram gerens per infinita secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Funde preces domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Explicit decalogus per manus fratris Ioh. Kopp anno etc. LX4to in die S. Albani martyris hora vesperorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 21. Juni 1464); dazu im Haupttext Interlinearglossen (Synonyme und Worterkl\u228 \'e4rungen).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition (Haupttext): Andr\u225 \'e1s \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 N\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 meth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , K\u246 \'f6z\u233 \'e9p-eur\u243 \'f3pai verses T\u237 \'edzparancsolat egy 15. sz\u225 \'e1zadi esztergomi iskol\u225 \'e1sk\u246 \'f6nyvben, in: Magyar K\u246 \'f6nyvszemle 123 (2007), S. 1-21, hierzu S. 11f. (zu dieser Hs. = Sigle M\plain \f1\sub\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) und 18-21 (Editionsteil); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Teaching, learning and preaching in a fifteenth-century rhyming decalogue, in:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20  Przestrze\u324 \'f1 religijna Europy \u346 \'8crodkowo-Wschodniej w \u347 \'9credniowieczu.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Religious space of east-central Europe in the Middle Ages. Proceedings of the conference of the Commission Internationale d'Histoire et d' Etude du Christianisme (CIHEC), Lublin-Lviv 6-10 september 2007, hrsg. von Krzysztof \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bracha\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20  / Pawe\u322 \'b3 Kras. Warschau 2010 (Przestrze\u324 \'f1 Religijna Europy \u346 \'8crodkowo-Wschodniej Otwarta na Wsch\u243 \'f3d i Zach\u243 \'f3d 2), S. 221-233, hierzu S. 229-233 (zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung S. 227); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Learning and preaching in Central Europe. The evidence of a late medieval rhyming decalogue, in: Annual of medieval studies at CEU 11 (2005), S. 77-96, hierzu S. 92-96 (Edition), S. 90f. (zu dieser Hs. = Sigle M\plain \f1\sub\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia carminum 8661, 18425.
