\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Est antichristi generatio nunc reuelanda}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iudicium domini veri finaliter extat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Explicit generacio antichristi anno domini MCCCC4to in vigilia Ioh. Baptiste}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 23. Juni 1464) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per me fratrem Iohannem Kopp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic dicit autor de generacione et vita}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et de eius ethymolacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  antichristi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sic est finis huius negocij in nomine Christi dei omnipotentis qui est benedictus in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgen vier Verse: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Presbyteri serui sunt omni tempore pigri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 21562) \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in domibus letus in stratis esto facetus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 8903).
