\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica I\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   in aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cvm appropinquasset Iesus ... (Mt 21,1). Ante inicium hodierni ewangelij}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   habetur Ioh. 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod ante sex dies pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vt simul gaudeant in corpore et anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit postilla discipuli super ewangelia dominicalia et super ewangelia de sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 collecta anno domini 1467}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ex postillis sermonialibus illorum doctorum scilicet ex postilla Nicolaij de Lyra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur modus legendi nomina doctorum abbreuiata in ista postilla etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ly id est Nicolay de Lyra doctor sacre theologie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Laus meo detur deo etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Folgt von anderer Hand Benutzereintrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1477\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   prima Iunij fui hoc in monasterio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 373 leer. 
