\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Claudius Ptolemaeus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cosmographia (translatio Jacobi Angeli de Scarperia) cum additamentis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cosmographya Ptolomeus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . < >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Beatissimo patri Allexandro quinto pontifici maximo Iacobus Angelus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad tempora Claudij Ptholomeij viri Allexandrini cogitanti michi illud occurrit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sed de hijs satis iam ad Ptholomeum ipsum latine loquentem audiamus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Claudij Ptholomei cosmographie liber primus habet ista capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum primum in quo differt cosmographia a corographia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch I, Kap. 1-23: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Claudij Ptolomei liber primus Cosmographye incipit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In quo differt cosmographia a corographia. Cosmographia designatrix mutacio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (! lies: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  imitatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est tocius cogniti orbis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ab equinocciali gradibus 8 1/3 et 1/12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; darunter Kommentar von der Hand des Fridericus Amann (mit Verweiszeichen >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <, >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <, >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 15m horis supra egressiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  boristhenis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) ...; (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kartographische Erl\u228 \'e4uterungen (dt. Einschub): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In der gegenwurtigen figur ist pegrifen dye auftailung der der (!) ganczen welt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  10 meil et 2/3 ainer meil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Textteile aus Buch II-VIII (116 \u8222 \'84sermones\ldblquote ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo prima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Post damnonios versus solis ortum magis Septentrionales}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  insigniorum insulae ciuitatum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Finis Claudij Ptolomei cosmographie in die Remigij episcopi 1449}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 1. Oktober 1449)<, darunter Nachtrag: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sciendum autem quod distat 3a parte vnius magni gradus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ende Buch 7: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Habitabilis nostre descripcio per regiones atque satrapias in hunc modum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   particulariter exposita sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ex parte Affrice et Europe iuxta vetustiorum traditiones. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Claudij Ptholomei Cosmographie septimus liber explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<; (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch 8 (Anfangstext ohne tabulae): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Claudij Ptolomei cosmographie hoc habet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum qua presumpcione facere oportet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  usque ad ultrosque polos zodiaci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Claudij Ptolomei viri Allexandrini cosmographie octauus et vltimus liber explicit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1449 in die Pirminij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 3. November 1449)<, folgt Nota zum Aufbau der ersten beiden B\u252 \'fccher: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  primo incipit liber iste subscripcio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Beatissimo patri Allexandro etc.< Ad tempora Claudij Ptolomei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch I, Kap. 24: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum 24. Qualiter in plano terra designatur perspicuo coequalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Modus describendi in tabula vltimos paralellos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  habet ad ipsum quam 20 ad 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1449. Claudij Ptholomei liber cosmographie primus explicit, sequitur 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch II (Anfang): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Claudij Ptolomei cosmographie liber secundus habet eiusdem tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ab hiperboreo oceano abluitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; folgen kartographische Symbole f\u252 \'fcr mons, montes insula, civitas usw.; (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Additamenta zu 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (durch zwei Verweiszeichen angezeigt): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Inueni extra librum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (folgt gestrichenes Wort).< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Semidya(metri) altrinsecus meridiani proximi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   e f continent lineam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  adequate sed ferme\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; auf 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Schemazeichnung der Erde in zwei konzentrischen Kreisen; (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Merkverse: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota de quantitate stadiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Est quater in palmo digitus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 5822); (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Definitionen: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota diligenter illos terminos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Promontorium est nota siue acies alicuius montis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  oriundam tamen dicunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Koordinatentabellen aus Buch II \endash  Buch VIII (nummeriert von 1-116 entsprechend der 116 \u8222 \'84sermones\ldblquote  von oben 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ibernie Britanie insule situs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber octauus Cosmigraphiani Ptholomei secundum longitudinem et latitudinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Magister Reinhardus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tabula longitudinum et latitudinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Illas longitudines et latitudines ciuitatum et insularum inveni extra VIII librum et illas rescriptas per magistrum Reynhardum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit Kosmographia Ptholomea in die Lamperti episcopi et martiris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 17. September [1449 (?)]); 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Druck: u. a. GW M36362 (= BSB-Ink P-857); die kartographischen Erl\u228 \'e4uterungen auf Bl. 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   sind ediert bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Durand\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Vienna-Klosterneuburg map corpus (wie oben), S. 371-373 (Appendix 11); die Koordinatentafeln von Magister Reinhardus, ebd., S. 347-362 (Appendix 7; diese Hs. = Sigle M-2). \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung der Zus\u228 \'e4tze auf 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   und 216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Wolfenb\u252 \'fcttel, HAB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. Guelf. 354 Helmst}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Vorlage dieser Hs.; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Durand\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Vienna-Klosterneuburg map corpus (wie oben), S. 168f., 128-130 und 175). \endash  Vgl. ferner \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Folkerts\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Fridericus Amann (wie oben), S. 195-197 und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gerl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Geographie (wie oben), S. 103f..\endash  Zu Jacobus Angelus vgl. Donatella \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coppini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: LexMA 5 (1991), Sp. 255-256. }

