\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Asia diuiditur in regiones.< Regna Asie sunt in numero quatuordecim}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quorum primum est Cathon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut indicet portum nauigantibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deo gracias ago omnipotenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
