\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Accessus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circa inicium presentis libelli videndum est primo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad omnes libros astronomicales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur textus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnia cum inferiora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ex quo omnia ista inferiora gubernantur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et in hoc terminatur computus Nurembergensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de quo deus gloriosus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnia cum inferiora motibus corporum superiorum gubernantur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si vero hoc idem ad oppositionem addideris veniet ter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quadra secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et in hoc terminat computus Nurembergensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit computus Nurembergensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et est finitus in die Thome apostolis sub anno domini 1434}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 21. Dezember 1434). (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Interlinearglossen: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnes res inferiores}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inferiora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  plenilunium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  apposicio media\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
