\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 ((95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ista propositio scribitur a philosopho quinto phisicorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic autor recolligit omnia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  producat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nos deus gloriosus in secula seculorum benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit secretum mulierum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haupttext: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dilectissimo sibi in Christo socio suo et carissimo N.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et vita eterna ad quam nos omnes perducat deus omnipotens et magnificus qui cum patre viuit et regnat per infinita secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  El \u8222 \'84De secretis mulierum\ldblquote  atribuido a Alberto Magno. Estudio, edici\u243 \'f3n cr\u237 \'edtica y traducci\u243 \'f3n, ed. Jos\u233 \'e9 Pablo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barrag\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 n Nieto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Porto 2012 (Textes et \u233 \'e9tudes du Moyen \u194 \'c2ge 63), S. 214-532, zu dieser Hs. vgl. S. 119, zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung des Kommentars vgl. S. 539. \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ferner Lynn \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A history of magic and experimental science during the first thirteen centuries of our era. Bd. 2, New York 1923 (History of science society publications. New series 4,2), S. 749f. (diese Hs. genannt). \endash  Zum Text vgl. Margaret \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schleissner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 8 (1990), Sp. 986-994, hierzu Sp. 988.
