\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine sancte et indiuidue trinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In presenti actu deo donante tria mihi per ordinem incumbunt facienda}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  primo quidem dominis zophistis sophismata proponam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et vltimo graciarum actiones referam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quantum ergo ad primum sophismum primum disputandum est illud, quilibet est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aptus uerbo supponere casus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Reffero gratiarum actiones, venerabili viro}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domino et magistro meo \u183 \'b7N\u183 \'b7 Lebaw facultatis arcium decano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  actus eius comparatur ad substantiam ut est idem sibi et reseruatur in ea sed et non egreditur etc. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
