\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 //\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a quibus quilibet tenetur abstinere. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Isti sunt tres (?) puncti essentiales nostre religionis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , sicut in qualibet alia religione sunt tria vota essencialia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui specialiter contines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   hereticos etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Beda \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dud\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 k\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Statuten des ersten Prager Provincial-Concils vom 11. und 12. November 1349. Im Anhange Tractatus de Tribus punctis essentialibus Christianae religionis von Thomas de Hybernya ... Br\u252 \'fcnn 1872, S. 83-113, hier S. 84, Z. 25 bis S. 88, Z. 3. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB Nr. 8129.1;\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   5134; Richard H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rouse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Mary A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rouse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Preachers, florilegia and sermons. Studies on the manipulus florum of Thomas of Ireland. Toronto 1979 (Studies and Texts 47), bes. S. 101-104.}

