\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Lancea}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Diaeta salutis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic incipit dieta salutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Daneben von anderer Hand,eher der Textura angelehnt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domini Heinrici dicti Kemnat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec est uia ... (Is 30,21). Magnam misericordiam facit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui erranti uiam ostendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et participes faciat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominator illius corree Ihesus Christus, virginis filius, qui cum deo patre ... Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit dieta salutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Druck: GW 4720-4735 (BSB-Ink G-495-499); S. Bonaventurae ... opera omnia, ed. Adolphe Charles \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Peltier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bd. 8. Paris 1866, S. 247-346. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventurae scripta, S. 132f. Nr. 124. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   2301. \endash  Bertrand-Georges \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Guyot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La \u8222 \'84Dieta salutis\ldblquote  et Jean Rigaud, in: Archivum Franciscanum Historicum 82 (1989), S. 360-393, Hs. S. 381 und Liste mit allen Drucken S. 385-387. \endash  S.a. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat18 Clm 14343}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . }

