\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De decem praeceptis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Audi Israel precepta domini etc. (vgl. Dt 4,1). Quod preceptum domini lucidum illuminans oculos (Ps 18,9). Hec est perfecta sciencia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sanctorum, scilicet X precepta dei, quia requiritur racio in nouissimo die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ergo fili serua precepta patris tui, id est dei tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et liga ea in corde tuo et iugiter de eis cogitando cum ambulaueris gradientur tecum, cum dormieris custodient te. Primum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Non habebis deos alienos coram me, id est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  me solum habe et in me crede\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  spiritibus nostris Christus coniungitur. Quod nobis prestare dignetur.
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De die dominica: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Veneranda est nobis dies que dicitur dominica}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Que ideo dominica dicitur, quia dies domini est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et perducat nos in sanctam ciuitatem Ierusalem. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: u.a. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clm 3766}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 2\u176 \'b0 Cod.ms. 120}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

