\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8210 ?44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Brevia collecta ad utilitatem simplicium desiderantium notitiam divinorum mysteriorum et officiorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit tractatus de diuinis misteriis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de horis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   missis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad honorem dei sanctorumque eius vt (lies: et) vtilitatem simplicium desiderancium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   noticiam diuinorum misteriorum et officiorum nec valencium magna procurare volumina neque comparare ea paupertatis pretextu hec breuia que secuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  resecatis superfluis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sunt collecta ut hec studendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  practicando et populum informando in deo proficient. Olim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sicut in lege veteri legitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in pectore summi pontificis rationale iudicii ponebatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De horis canonicis est sciendum primo quod ideo dicuntur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  canonice id est regulares quia secundum regulas sanctorum patrum et diuini eloquii sunt tradite \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sequitur nunc de cimiterio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De ordinibus et eius annexis notandum quod ordines sunt septem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   secundum septem dona spiritus sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quatuor minores scilicet hostiariatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De missa nota quod dicitur a mittendo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De defectibus autem et periculis contingentibus circa hec est primo notandum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quod quilibet celebrans diligentissime se preparare debet \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   virtutes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   merita et tandem eterna gloria. Ad quam nos perducat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; Schreiberspruch \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deo gracias.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Im laufenden Text vorkommende Jahreszahlen (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1451\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1439\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zu Messerkl\u228 \'e4rungen im Gefolge von Guilelmus\rquote  Durantis Rationale divinorum officiorum vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Franz, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Messe, S. 482, 493, 506; zu Abbreviaturen gro\u223 \'dfer Standardwerke im Mittelalter zwecks allgemeiner Verwendung vgl. Franz Josef\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Worstbrock, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Libri pauperum, in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Ausgew\u228 \'e4hlte Schriften 1, hrsg. von Susanne\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 bele \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Andreas\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Kra\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u223 \'df\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 .\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Stuttgart\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 2004, S. 338\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u8210 ?\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 364, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  bes. S. 354\u8210 ?364.}

