\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8210 ?95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Hagen de Indagine}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber contra Hussitas}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Illustri principi et domino domino Frederico marchioni Brandenborgensi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   burgrauio N\u252 \'fcrenbergensi et sacri imperii archicamerario frater Iohannes carthusiensium apud Frankenfordt invtilis seruitor vtriusque hominis salutem et perpetuam in Cristo Ihesu pacem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gloriosissime ac cristianissime atque deuote princeps vtrumque satisfeci licet breuiter iussioni vestre scribens aliqua prout menti occurrebant diuina \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et ad eum finaliter et feliciter perueniat per Cristum dominum nostrum\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Schreibereintr\u228 \'e4ge \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sit laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Im laufenden Text vorkommende Jahreszahlen (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1437\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1439\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1450\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1460\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8210 ?96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Vgl. Dieter\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Mertens, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 3 (1981), Sp. 389\u8210 ?398, Sp. 395 Hs. genannt; Stephen M\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 . Metzger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The manuscripts of writings by Ioannes Hagen de Indagine, O. Cart., in: Bulletin de philosophie m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale 50 (2009), S. 175\u8210 ?256, hier S. 211 Nr. 59, diese Hs., und S. 244. }

