\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8210 ?114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Instructio praedicatoris (Ars praedicandi)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fifili (lies: Fili) hominis vade \u8230 \'85 (Ez 3, 4). Quia ex ore domini predicator audire debet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   verba diuina et ea loqui ad populum ad quem a domino deo mittitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et cito de aliis festis formabit sermones ad laudem dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ad edificacionem populi salutemque propriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad quam filius dei benedictus nos perducat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 7 Kapitel; zit. 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Henricus de Hassia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (gest. 1397).  Schreiberspruch \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Laus omnipotenti deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8210 ?120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
