\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit tractatus magistri Samuelis Israhelite per quem probatur aduentus Cristi siue Messie dudum preteritus per dicta prophetarum et libros legis veteris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   per fratrem Alfonsum Bonihominis ordinis predicatorum de arabico in latinum translatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Dedicatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Reuerendissimo in Cristo patri Hugoni}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titulus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Incipit epistola translata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Epistola quam scripsit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; Salutatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Conseruet te deus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Narratio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Noui et expertus sum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; Kap. 1 \u8250 \'9bPeticio, Capitulum primum\u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Desidero, domine mi, certificari per te ex testimoniis legis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kap. 26 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum vicesimum sextum docens dicta Sarracenorum et Machmeti de Cristo et beata virgine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Certe, domine mi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut corruptus homo penitus uel ignorans. Et ego frater Alfonsus Bonihominis Hyspanus ad instanciam vestri hec addidi ad translacionem illam quam feci nuper magistro ordinis nostri de epistola Samuelis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sub anno domini millesimo tricentesimo tricesimo nono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   domini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  predicti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  durchgestrichen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Benedicti pape duodecimi anno eius quinto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Schreibereintrag\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Et sic est finis huius operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8210 ?155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
