\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad Venetos reuerendi in Christo patris domini Zacharie Ferrariensis Vincentinj S\u250 \'fabasiensis abbatis de eorum dominio breui dir\u250 \'faendo et vt ad cor re\u250 \'faertantur elegia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Adriaci regina maris Veneteque paludis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Plangito et in lacrimis pallida tinge genas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non humana teret te: sed diuina potestas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum summis etenim sunt tibi bella deis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Data Venetijs XXI kl. Decembris M.D.VIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: u.a. Zaccaria Ferreri, Ad Venetos Reuerendi in Christo pat. d[omi]ni Zacharie \u8230 \'85 [N\u252 \'fcrnberg 1509] (VD 16 ZV 5798); vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 llner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   I (wie oben), Nr. 31 (S. 34).}

