\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec sequencia ut fertur presagia in funda eleuacionis virginis cuiusdam diue in vrbe Roma inuenta sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antequam transibit 1512 Veneti sola Venecia contentari conabuntur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Annis non dum expiratis 1515 Turcorum secta erit deleta.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ante annos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1526 totus mundus vnum deum Christum adorabit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
