\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Medela animae vulneratae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic liber erudiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qualiter homo per penitentiam et confessionem et satisfactionem a peccatis expurgari debeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic liber intitulatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Medela anime wlnerate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qui crediderit et secundum doctrinam huius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  libri se rexerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  saluus erit in Christo Jesv domino nostro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In principio narrationis nostre illius gratiam adiutorium imploremus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85  \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  auxiliante spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancti gratia edocebo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit salubris uia anime erranti a salute ut conuertatur ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum igitur prelatus aliquis ordinis nostri iuditium habens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  votis omnibus deprecor et exoro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod nobis prestare dignetur dominus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ihesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Anhang: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rubrica de septem principalibus uiciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Septem sunt principalia uitia}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Superbia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 inuidia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Septima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et libera nos a malo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Vgl. Pierre \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommes de casuistique et manuels de confession au Moyen \u194 \'c2ge. L\u246 \'f6wen 1962 (Analecta mediaevalia Namurcensia 13), S. 92; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   2652. \u8210 ? Zum Anhang vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   5888 (\u8218 \'82Arbor peccati et vitiorum\lquote ).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

