\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit de horologio secundum alzalchoram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   id est speram rotundam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In primis de horis diei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Quando queris scire horas diei, pones gradum solis circulum medi\u281 \'ea terr\u281 \'ea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quando queris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24 scire altitudinem cuiuslibet terr\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et quando bene inquisierit gradum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inueniet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  certitudinem horarvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
