\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 ((117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) c. I, 4 (Beginn in etwa der Mitte des Kapitels, dann folgt Anfangsteil): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quid sit abacvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Abacus uocatur mensa geometricalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que et in numeris et formis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  numerorum diuisa et ad subtilitatem constat tenuissima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et actualis operatio compensanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Diuiditur tota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  abaci quantitas \u183 \'b7XXVI\u183 \'b7 incisionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In his itaque dimensionibus describuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  numerorum termini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) c. I, 2 (Anfang): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sunt enim insignes VIIII numerorum caracteres}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicuntur sedes horum numerorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; abweichend (vgl. c. II, 1): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Singularis quemcumque multiplicat in eodem digitos ponit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et in ulteriori articulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Centies mille M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  compositus denominationem non abit ad partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) c. II, 2-3: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De digitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Digiti appellantur minores numeri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ex qualibet multiplicatione concreti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De articulis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Articuli nuncupantur maiores numeri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   similiter ex multiplicatione aliqua producti dicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quadragies terni sunt \u183 \'b7C\u183 \'b7XX\u183 \'b7 deceno uel c\u183 \'b7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 no\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   locum obtineat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) abweichend vom Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Diuisor in singulari sit constitutus ac diuidendis in eodem arcu}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \u8210 ? \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  decenus decenvm et ceteri eodem modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
